<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MARK-NGINDO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Maluk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nhwalo Gwambone oguandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maluko</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Maluko nga kati ja itabu ncheche ya Mulilagano Liyono elilanduli kutama kwa Yesu Kilisto padunia. Kila kitabu kikemigwa, “Injili” mana gakwe, “Nhwalo Gwambone.” Uandikigwa na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana kuboka pukujomoka Yesu. Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Maluko nnyipi kati ja Minhalo ncheche jenie. Iaminika kutenda kitabu cha Maluko nga chukutumbu kuandikigwa kati ja Minhalo joa ni kiandikigwa kati ja chaka cha 65-70 kuboka pukujomoka Yesu. Akachomi ajingi baamine kutenda uandikigwa Kuloma kupala kalimbia mwojo bandu abunhwamini Kilisto bu Kuloma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maluko, uyo akonda Yohana Maluko, akiba ndundame nnyabe akina Paulo na Banaba nambu ichima jakwe ngibuja unyuma gambu gukikiboya mu mwanja gu kimisheni (Itendwa 13:13). Kubokapenia Maluko ngaboka mwanja pamwe na Banaba (Itendwa 15:37-39). Maluko uyo ngamanyikana nng'anja mundu muno jwa Petulo (1 Petulo 5:13). Iganukube Maluko akiba nchaili ju kuibona mweneje kutama kwa Yesu padunia, akachomi baamini kutenda Maluko aandika kupete uchalakichi gwa Petulo gwenio nga nng'omba gu kitabu chenje. Mu Nhwalo Gwambone gongo, Maluko akachani nhwalo gukube napunji na maboulo ga Yesu kingobu chukupela.</para>
  <para style="iot">Agabi mukitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Maluko akilaite kitabu chenje mu lipungu lya 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe Maluko alanduli maengo ga Yesu kingobu pakiba ku Galilaya mu lipungu lya 1:14-8:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Kubokapenia alenga mwanja gwa Yesu ku Yelusalemu (Lipungu lya 8:22-10:52).</para>
  <para style="io">Maluko ajomoli kuandika nhwalo gwa Yesu kingobu pakiba ku Yelusalemu, pamwe nu nhwalo gwa kiu chakwe nu kuyoka (Lipungu lya 11:1-16:8).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kutangacha kwa Yohana Mmatichi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Gongo nga Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Yesu Kilisto, Mwana jwa Nnoongo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Itumbula andi apiandikigwe na Isaya nnondoli jwa Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="q">“Nnoongo ngalenga, ‘Mbakunkinga mmanda jwango annongolele,</para>
  <para style="q">kumpanganakia ndela jinu.’</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mundu achobe papongoti,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ntendekeye ndela ja Angwana,</para>
  <para style="q">mmeke kipola mubapakupeta!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohana Mmatichi apitila papongoti, ngatangacha na kabaticha bandu, ngabalenge, “Nnapange mabaja ginu nu kubatichigwa, Nnoongo mannekekea mabaja ginu.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi kuboka kukilambo cha Yudea nu Kuyelusalemu ngabannyendele Yohana, ngabalapanga mabaja gabe, nukubatichigwa mulukemba lwa Yolidani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yohana akwinda ngobo ji majuni ga ngamia, nu luunga lu limbendela mukibuno chakwe, chakulya chakwe kikiba maige na buchi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yohana ngabalenge bandu, “Munalome ojwapakuika kuboka pango nenga akweti uwecho kumbeta nenga. Mbaligwije kulita ukulugula ngoji yi ilatu yakwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nenga nammatichanga kwa mache, nambu jwenio ammatichanga ku Uhuke jwa Chwapi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubatichigwa nu kulondoigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matayo 3:13-4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Machoba majingije, Yesu ngaika kuboka kukilambo chi Kunazaleti kunkoa gu Kugalilaya, ngabatichigwa na Yohana mulukemba lwa Yolidani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kingobutu Yesu papita umache, ngajibona mbengu jiekwike nu Uhuke jwa Chwapi akaika kutola panani jakwe andi ngunda. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ni lilobe ngilijoanika kuboka kumbengu, kulenga, “Mwenga Mamanango manumpala manhwalalile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kingobu tu Uhuke jwa Chwapi ngannongaleya kupongoti, <verse number="13" style="v"/>kwenio ngatama machoba alubaini, Lichetani ngilinnondoya. Ni inyama ya mpongoti yakiba ukwo, nambu akapakachi kuboka kumbengu ngabaika kummegelela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bakemanga akakoki ancheche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matayo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yohana apakiba mukipungo, Yesu ngajenda Kugalilaya ngatangacha Nhwalo Gwambone gwa Nnoongo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Kingobu chambone kiike, ni kingwana cha Nnoongo kibandakile. Nnapange mabaja ginu nhwamini nhwalo gwambone!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu apapeta umbwega ji lilaba li Kugalilaya, ngababona akakoki akabele Simoni nu ununu gwakwe Andulea, bakakokanga yamaki na mapelele.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:16">Mundu akoka yamaki nilipelele</figure> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Ungengamange nenga manammekanga mme makakoki ba bandu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na angweto ngabagalekanga mapelele gabe, ngabankengama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apabaika nnongi kachoko, ngababonanga Yakobo na Yohana, ingota ya Zebedayo. Muntumbwi gwabe bakatendekeanga mapelele gabe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu apababonanga, ngakema, angweto ngabankengama Yesu na kaleka awamundu ana Zebedayo muntumbwi pamwe na akakamu maengo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu juna nchepela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu na akinapunji bakwe Lichoba li Kupomalela, ngabajendanga Kukafalanaumu, Yesu ngajingi munyumba ji kugongalela, ngabola. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bandu bao ngabaomongwa maboulo gakwe, gambu abola andi mundu ojwakweti kinala, ngiti andi akaboli babe ba Malagiloje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kingobu ucho ngajingi mundu juna nchepela munyumba ji kungongalela ngachobela, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mpala ni kwito, Yesu ju Kunazaleti? Bo nhwikila kutujomola? Numanyi mwe, mwe machwapi mankingigwe na Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu ngaukalapila nchepela gwenio, “Nkotoke! Mammoke mundu jwenio!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nchepela ngugunnyukanyuka mundu jwenio, ngaguta kanonoya, ngammoka mundu jwenio. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabaomongwa ngabakonyana, “Chenie nga nike? Maboulo mayono? Mundu jwenio akweti kinala chu kubenga michepela najenie kunnyoa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Minhalo ja Yesu ngijijoanika kilambo choa chi Kugalilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamianga bandu ndu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu na akinapunji bakwe pamwe na Yakobo na Yohana ngabapita munyumba ji kugongalela, ngabajenda kachakwe Simoni na Andulea. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Akimundu Simoni akege, bakiba pikindanda, atamwe, paika Yesu ngabannengela. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajendele amama benia, ngabakamula, ngabajinula. Kitamwe ngachaboka, amama benia ngababegelelanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kimuyo bandu ngabannete Yesu akatamwe ndu bina michepela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bandu ndu bi kilambo chenie ngabaikanga pulubanja lwa nyumba jenie. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalamiyanga bandu ajingi abakiba na itamwe, ngajibenga michepela mijingi, na ngajikanalila kulongela michepela jenie, magambu jamanyi jwenio nga meneke.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atangacha kukilambo chi Kugalilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kindabi jakwe, Yesu ngajimuka ngajenda pajika jakwe, kungongalela. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nambu Simoni na akajakwe ngabampalapala, <verse number="37" style="v"/>apabammona ngabanenge, “Kila mundu atenda kumpalapala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Tujende kuijiji yenge eibi papipi, gambu kwenio, mbaligwa kutangacha Nhwalo Gwambone uyo, magambu inkila kwa genia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Penia ngajenda kila kijiji chi Kugalilaya ngatangacha mumajumba gu kugongale nu kubenga michepela.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamiya mundu juna maloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mundu jumwe juna maloi ngaika kwa Yesu ngakilikitila ngajopa, “Anda mpaile unyeguye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu ngammone kia, ngatondobea luboko lwakwe, ngankunyula nu kunnenge, “Mbala, nnyeguke!” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kingobucho maloi ngagammoka mundu jwenio ngajeguka. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kubokapenia Yesu ngannenge mundu jwenio ajabule nu kunkelebuya, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Mpenakia, makannengeje mundu jwajoa kilebe chenie. Nambu nnyende mikikilaye kunkung'i jwa Nnoongo. Na makapange lilumbo kukujeguka kwinu andi apaamulicha Musa kupala kachalakicha angweto kutenda nnamite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nambu mundu jwenio, ngajenda ngalandulila nhwalo gwenio kila paali. Nu kulenga ilebe ijingi na Yesu aotwije kabe kujingila mukilambo cha chochoa kukubonekana, ngatama panja, pajikajakwe. Na bandu ngabannyendela kuboka kila paali.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mundu ojwapolite mmele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Machoba majingije, Yesu ngabuja kabele Kukafalanaumu, bandu ngabajoa kutenda abi kachakwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi ngabakongana kwenio kabe kiigije chumbi changa bandu, mpaka panniango na panja poa. Kwenio Yesu ngabatangachila Nhwalo Gwambone. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bandu akancheche ngabaika bampotwi mundu ojwapolite mmele gwoa ngabanneta kwa Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwa magambu ga bandu ajingi, baotwije kumpeleka unyumba mwakiba Yesu, penia ngabapojo pikinyanga kipola na Yesu, ngabanhuluya mundu jwenio bang'onike pilikai. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu apaibona imani yabe, ngannenge mundu jwenio, ojwapolite, “Manango, mabaja ginu galekekiigwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bange akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa, abatamangite penia ngabawacha mumyojo jabe, <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Alongebo yene? Antukana Nnoongo! Abije mundu jwaotwi kulekekeya mabaja, Nnoongo tu nga ojwaotwile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie Yesu ngamanya mawacho gabe, ngabakonya, “Mboni nhwachanga genia mumyojo jinu? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kini chikibi kindema muno kunnenge mundu ojwapolite, ‘Nnekekiigwe mabaja ginu?’ Andaje ‘Kunnenge nnyinuke, ntole likai linu nnyabule’? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nampala mmanyange kutenda, Mwana jwa Mundu akweti kinala cha kalekekeya bandu mabaja gabe pannema.” Penia ngannenge mundu ojwapolite, <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Na nnenge, nnyeme, ntole likai linu nnyabu kachinu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kingobu bandu boa bakannolekea, mundu jwenio ngajinuka, ngatola likai lyakwe, ngajabula. Bandu boa ngabaomongwa ngabannumba Nnoongo, ngabalenga, “Tanalolaje kilebe andi eche!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu ngajenda kabele umbwega ji lilaba elikonda Galilaya. Bandu ajingi ngabannyendelela na ngababolanga. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kingobu apapeta, ngammona ntocha kodi ojwakemigwa Lawi, mwana jwa Alufayo, atamite panyumba ju kutocha kodi. Yesu ngannenge, “Ungengame.” Lawi ngajinuka ngankengama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuboka penia, Yesu apakiba akalya chakulya, kachakwe Lawi. Akatocha kodi ajingi na bina mabaja ngabankengama Yesu na bange ngababe bakalya pamwe na akinapunji bakwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bange akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa, abakonda Mafalisayo, apabammona Yesu akalya pamwe na bandu bina malemwa na akatocha kodi ngabakonya akinapunji bakwe, “Mboni alye pamwe na akatocha kodi na bandu bina malemwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga kulenga, “Bandu banga itamwe kunkemaje nng'anga, abankema nng'anga akatamwe. Nhikila kakema bandu ababikibona kube bamboneje, nambu nhikila kakema bina mabaja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nhwalo gu kupunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Akinapunji ba Yohana Mmatichi na akinapunji ba Mafalisayo batenda kupunganga. Bandu bange ngabaikanga, ngabankonya Yesu. “Mboni akinapunji ba Yohana Mmatichi na ba Mafalisayo batenda kupunganga, nambu akinapunji binu babi kupungaje?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Bo, bandu abakokigwe kumpapala gukutola akege bapaligwa kupunga kingobu akoano babi pamwe nabo? Mangobu pababe pamwe na akoano ipaligwije kupunga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambu, makiika kingobu akoano bapakuboigwa penia nga apabapaligwa kupunga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Abije mundu ojwabeka kibamba cha ngobo nhyono mungobo ng'ona, mmanya kibamba kiyono kibakupapu ngobo ng'ona, nu kujonjakea lilanga. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Abije mundu ojwajela divai nhyono mukitumba kigona, gambu anda atei yene, divai jibakupachula kitumba chenie na divai jipakualabika, ipaligwa divai nhyono kubeka mukitumba kiyono.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukonya nhwalo gwa Lichoba li Kupomolela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lichoba limwe li Kupomolela, Yesu na akinapunji bakwe apeta mumigonda ja ngano, undela akinapunji bakwe ngabatumbu kuchwamu myejo ja ngano. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mafalisayo pababonanga ngabankonya Yesu, “Mboni akinapunji binu batendanga gangapaligwa Lichoba li Kupomolela?” Nno ote!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Bo nchomangitije patenda Daudi nakajakwe apabakiba na njala? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Daudi ngajingi unyumba ja Nnoongo, ngalye mikate ejibekigwe lilumbo likunnumba Nnoongo. Genia gapitila kingobu Abiasali apakiba Nkung'i nkolongwa. Malagilo galenga Nkung'i tu ojwapaligwe kulye mikate jenie. Nambu ngalye Daudi uyo ngabape bandu bakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga “Lichoba li Kupomolela libekigwe magambu ga bandu, na bandu babekigweje magambu gu Lichoba likupomolela. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yene, Mwana jwa Mundu akweti uwecho ata Lichoba li Kupomolela!”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia ojwapolite luboko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngajingi kabele munyumba ji kugongalela na mwenio akiba mundu ojwapolite luboko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Munyumba mwenio bakiba bandu bapala bantakiane Yesu, yene ngabannolekea anda mannamia mundu Lichoba li Kupomolela. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngannenge mundu jwenio ojwapolite luboko, “Nhwike nnongi.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngabakonya bandu, “Bo, chako chikipaligwa kutenda mumalagano gito Lichoba li Kupomolela kutenda kilebe chambone andaje kutenda kilebe changambone?” Kukombo bwomi andaje koma? Nambu angweto ngabatamanga nuu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabalolakea ku lilaka, ngababone kia kwa magambu ga kujundupa myojo jabe. Napenia ngannenge mundu jwenio, “Ntondobeye luboko lwinu!” Na jwenio ngatondabeya, luboko lwakwe ngululama. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mafalisayo ngagapita panja, ngababeka machabuli pamwe na bandu ba Helode, kupala ndela ji kunkoma Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Nkenga gwa bandu umbwega ji lilaba likolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka penia pamwe na akinapunji bakwe, ngabajenda umbwega ji lilaba likolongwa li Kugalilaya, nankengeni nkolongwa gwa bandu ngunkengama. Bandu benia baika kuboka kuilambo ya Galilaya nu Kuyudea, <verse number="8" style="v"/>kuboke Kuyelusalemu kilambo cha Idumea, kwie ju lukemba lwa Yolidani, ku Tilo na ku Sidoni. Bandu benia ajingi ngabannyendele Yesu kwa magambu ga kujoa ilebe ijingi eyatenda. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge akinapunji bakwe bampali ntumbwi gumwe, kupala bandu bakamandakije. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Akiba balamiinge bandu ajingi, na akatamwe boa bapalanga kupekenyela kupala kakunyula. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bandu bina michepela kila apabammona Yesu, ngabagwe pae nnongi jakwe nu kuchobela, “Mwe Mwana jwa Nnoongo!” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabaamulicha kutenda bakalenge banduje kutenda jwenio nga meneke.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu achagula akinapunji komi na abena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu ngaombe pikitombi, ngabakemanga abapaile. Na benia ngabannyendelela, <verse number="14" style="v"/>ngabapambula bandu komi na abena, ngabakonda achandundame. Ngabalenge, “Nanchagulinge mmegange pamwe na nenga. Na uyo mbakumtumanga kutaali makatangache ku bandu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Na mampata kinala chu kuboya michepela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Benia komi na abena abapambuligwe, Simoni, Yesu ngampe liina Petulo, <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yakobo na Yohana, ingota ya Zebedayo Yesu ngaipe liina lya Boanelige, mana gakwe “Bandu bukulindima,” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Andulea na Filipo na Batolomayo na Matayo na Tomasi na Yakobo mwana jwa Alufayo na Tadei na Simoni Nkanaani, <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yuda Isikalioti ojwanng'aluka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Mmaja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kubokapenia Yesu ngajabula kachakwe. Bandu ajingi ngabakongana kabele, mpaka Yesu na akinapunji bakwe kuchipu kulye. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Akalongomundu apabajoa genia, ngabajenda kuntola, magambu bandu balenga, “Ntamwe machonjo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bange akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa kuboka Kuyelusalemu, ngabalenga, “Akweti Belizebuli, kabe ajibenga michepela kwa makakala ga nkolongwa ju michepela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabakema, ngabalenge kukulandanakia, “Lichetani liotwabo kuliboya Lichetani? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Anda kingwana chimwe kikibagine ikuta ikuta eijomana, kingwana chenie kipakugwe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Anda lungolo lumwe lukibagine ikuta ikuta eijomana, lungolo lwenio lubakupela. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Anda kingwana chi Lichetani kikibagine ikuta ikuta ichimwine, kingwana chenie kipakugwe nu kujomoka mbyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Abije mundu ojwapakuoto kujingi munyumba ja mundu juna makakala nu kumpoka ilebe yoa, mpaka antabe oti mundu jwenio, penia apakuoto kumpoka ilebe yoa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nannenge kweli, Nnoongo mabalekekeya bandu mabaja gabe goa na matukano gabe goa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nambu abapakuntukana Uhuke jwa Chwapi balekekeigwaje ngu, babi na mabaja machoba goa pangapela.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu alenga yene gambu bannenga “Akweti nchepela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Amama ninung'una ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Amamundu Yesu ninung'una yakwe ngaba jenda penia, ngabajema panja, ngabantuma mundu ankeme Yesu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi bakiba batamangite penia kuntindila. Ngabannenge, “Amabinu na inuna inu bankema panja.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Amabango ni inuna yango nga beneke?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Penia ngabalolekea bandu abantindilinge, ngalenga, “Nno! Bamba nga akamabango na inunayango. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mundu jwajwoa ojwakamu agapala Nnoongo, jwenio nga nkaka gwango, nnombo gwango na amama bango.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na mpandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngatumbu kubola kabele kiti abi umbwega ja lilaba likolongwa li Kugalilaya. Nkengeni ogukiba penia ukiba nkolongwa penia Yesu ngaombe mutumbwi ngatama mwenio. Na bandu boa ngabatamanga pajomo umbwega ji lilaba likolongwa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngababolanga ilebe ijingi kukulandanakia, ngabalengela,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Mpenekiange! Akiba mundu ojwajenda kumicha mbeju. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apamicha mbeju munng'onda, yenge ngitola undela, ijuni ngiika ngionyola. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yenge ngitola pamaganga panga lutope lujingi. Ngimalika chokwe, magambu lutope lukiba lujingije. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lumu pulubala, ngilembuka, magambu mikega jakwe jikiba yeluyelu, ngijoma. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yenge ngitola pimikongo jamiba, na miba ngikola nu kuibalakia ipambikije. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambu yenge mbeju ngitola pulutope lwambone, ngimalika, ngikola nukupambika, lumwe mbonji salasini na yenge sitini na yenge mia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngabalenge, “Juna machikilo ajoe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulonge kukulandanakia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba jika jakwe, kati ja abakampenakia ngabanyendelela pamwe na akinapunji bakwe komi na abena, ngabankonya mana gukulonge kukulandanakia kwenio. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Mangwetomwe nkweti upeele gu kumanya chili ji kingwana cha Nnoongo,” nambu bange ababi panja kila kilebe balengela kukulandanikia, <verse number="12" style="v"/>ku yenie,</para>
  <para style="q">“ ‘Balolanga kweli,</para>
  <para style="q">nambu bijibonaje,</para>
  <para style="q">Bapenekianga kweli nambu bamanyaje.</para>
  <para style="q">Bakatei yene kabi mantendebuki Nnoongo, na jwombe kabi balekakiye.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alandulila kulandanikia kwa mpandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngabakonyanga, “Mangweto mmanyije kulandanakia kongono? Mmanyabo, kulandanakia konge? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mpandi ngapanda lilobe lya Nnoongo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bandu bange babi andi mbeju eitoi pandela, lilobe anda lipandigwe. Lichetani kuika kuliboya. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bandu bange babi andi mbeju eitoi pamaganga. Kingobu tu pibilijoa lilobe lyenie, kulipokela kukuala mwojo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nambu kolaje ngega nkati jakwe, aijendekea kuliagabala lilobe lyene kingobu tu, kingobu chu kulaga ni michwembo apajipitila magambu ga lilobe lyene, kuotwaje kujendekea. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bandu bange andi mbeju eitoile pamiba. Benia nga abajoa lilobe lyenie, <verse number="19" style="v"/>nambu mbwele ja bwomi, kupala uloi na tama ji kupala ilebe ndu, kajingila na kuliibilikia lilobe lyenie, na benia kupambikaje ngokwa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambu bandu bange babi anda mbeju eipandigwe pulutope lwambone. Benia kulijoa lilobe, kulipokela, nu kupambika ngokwa, bange salasini na bange sitini na bange mya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli nhwina ji lidebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulongela, “Bo, abi mundu ojwapamba lumuli nu kubeka nhwina andaje kuluekelela lidebe? Ije! Nambu kulubeka panani putala. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kila chikiigwe kiba kubonekana pukongolou na kila chikiekeligwe kiba kuekuligwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Juna machikilo ajoe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Uyo ngabalenge, “Mpenekianga gwicho echimikijoa! Kipemo chimapemelanga bandu bange, ngucho achapakumpeme Nnoongo, kabe nu kunnyonjekea. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Magambu mundu juna kilebe majonjekeigwa, nambu jwanga kola kilebe, na chache kichoko cha kweti kipakutoligwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na mbeju eimalika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulongela, “Kingwana cha Nnoongo kibi andi nyene. Mundu apanda mbeju kung'onda gwakwe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kilo abe lugono na mui abe mio mangobu genia nga pimalika mbeju nu ukola, jwenio kumanyaje apitendigwa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lutope nga olutenda kipandwa kimalike nukola nu kupambika, kutumbu kututuba liamba lilegalau, kubokapenia mwejo, nu kujomolela mbonji nkati ja mwejo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Luponji apulukomala, mundu atumbu kupeta na mbopo, gambu mangobu ga mauno gaike.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:29">Mundu apeta na mbopo</figure></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia na mbeju njokonjoko eikemigwa haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kabe Yesu ngalenga, “Kingwana cha Nnoongo tulandanakie na nike?” “Tulenga kilandine na nike? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kibi yene. Mundu ngatola mbeju ya haladali eibi njokonjoko kupeta yoa eibi pannema, mundu ngatola nu kupanda pulutope. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu andaipandigwe, kumalika nu kube litutwe likolongwa kupeta mikongo joa ju mung'onda. Ndambi yakwe ikola ni ijuni kuchenga mihui jakwe mundambi yenie.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu ngabatangachila bandu nhwalo gwakwe, kukulandanakia andi yene, ngalonge nabo na angweto ngabamanya echalongela. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Alongije chachoa panga landanakia, nambu apakiba pamwe na akinapunji bakwe ngabalenge kila kilebe kipola.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aamulicha kimboonga kikotoke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kimuyo, lichoba ulyo, Yesu ngabalenge akinapunji bakwe, “Tujomboke tujende kwiye ji lilaba.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Penia ngubulekanga nkengeni gwa bandu, akinapunji bakwe ngabajingi muntumbwi mwakiba Yesu, ngabajabulanga. Penia pakiba ni mitumbwi jenge. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kingobucho tu kimboonga kikolongwa ngikitumbula kuguguma, mawimbi ngagaputa ntumbwi na ntumbu gwenio ngutwele mache.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:37">Kimboonga kipakupendengu ntumbwi</figure> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu akagoloka kuagami nhwagamilo unyuma ja ntumbwi. Akinapunji bakwe ngaba nnyimuya kulenga, “Aboli, bo, mboni kuagabaje tupa kuwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu ngajimuka, ngakiamulicha ngimbonga, kulenga, “Nkotoke!” Ngagalenge mawimbi, “Nnende!” Penia kimbonga ngikikotoka, na ngukube jee. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kubokapenia Yesu ngabalenge akinapunji bakwe, “Mboni nnyogopanga? Bo, tango mmilingitije na imani?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nambu ngabajogopanga muno, ngabalengalana, “Mundu ni ojo, upepo na mawimbi kunnyoa?”</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mundu juna michepela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu na akinapunji bakwe ngabaika kukilambo cha Akagelasi, kwie ji lilaba likolongwa Kugalilaya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kingobu Yesu apauluka muntumbwi, ngakongana na mundu aboka kamakabuli. Mundu ojwakiba ni michepela, <verse number="3" style="v"/>na atama kamakabuli. Na akibaje mundu ojwaotwile kuntaba kabena mitondolo, <verse number="4" style="v"/>kingobu chenge bantabanga pingu ni mitondolo nambu kila mangobu ngaotola kueketa mitondolo nu kutunulana pingu yene, na akibaje mundu ojwaotwile kunhibilikia. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Atama kamakabuli nu kiitombi kilo na mui, akachobela nu kukikechanga mabwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Akiba kutaali kingobu apammona Yesu, yene ngammutakila, ngakilikitila majugwa nnongi ja Yesu, <verse number="7" style="v"/>na ngalenga kanonoya, “Yesu, Mwana jwa Nnoongo ojwabi kunani muno! Mpala nike kwango nenga? Ku liina lya Nnoongo, nannyopa makambotekaje!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Alongela genia magambu Yesu annengi, “Nchepela nchapu, mumoke mundu jwenio.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yene Yesu ngankonya jwenio, “Lina linu mabeneke?” Mundu jwenio ngajanga, “Lina lyango, ‘Matyala,’ Magambu tubi tajingi.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kubokapenia jwenio ngannyopa Yesu akajibengaje michepela mukilambo chenie. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kikiba kipenga kikolongwa chi magolobe papipi na penia pululela kamachela gi kitombi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Michepela jenie ngijinnyopa Yesu, “Mutupeleke kwa magolobe, takagajingile.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu ngajijeketela, michepela jenie ngijimpita mundu jwenio ngijijingi mumagolobe. Kipenga choa cha magolobe agakiba elufu ibena ngikielela puelelo mpaka kulilaba, ngikijingila mumache.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Akachungi ba magolobe ngabatilanga, nukutangacha nhwalo gweno kunnyini nu muilambo yoa ibandakile. Bandu ngabaikanga kugabona agapitile, <verse number="15" style="v"/>kingobu pabanhwikalila Yesu, ngabammona mundu ujwajo ojwakiba na matyala gi michepela atamite penia, akwinditi ngobo na abi namalango gakwe, na boa ngabajogopanga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bandu abibweni ikobo yenie ngabalanduli bandu ikobo eimpatite mundu jwenio ojwakiba na nchepela nhwalo gwa magolobe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuboka penia bandu ngabatumbu kunnyopa Yesu aboke mukilambo chabe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kingobu tu Yesu ngaombe muntumbwi, mundu ojwakiba na nchepela ngannyopa kulongwana nakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ajeketileje, nambu ngalenga, “Nnyabule kachinu kwakalongo binu makalandulila ilebe yoa Angwana eibantendile na kia jibakweti kwinu mwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Penia, mundu jwenio ngajabula, ngatumbu kutangacha kwenio ku Dekapoli ikobo yoa Yesu eyantendile, bandu boa abajoa genia ngabaomongwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Biti Yailo nu munkege ojwakunyula ngobo ja Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kingobu Yesu pajomboka kabele kwie ji lilaba likolongwa, nkengeni nkolongwa gwa bandu nguguntindila, Yesu kiti abi umbwega ji lilaba. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuboka penia kilongoi jumwe jwa nyumba ji kung'ongale Nnoongo liina lyakwe Yailo, ngaika penia. Apammona Yesu, ngakilakatila nnongi ja Yesu, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ngannyopa kulenga, “Nhwenja jwango ntamwe ambajomoka. Chonde tujende, makammeke maboko ginu, jwenio malama nu kube mmomi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngajabu nakwe. Bandu ajingi ngabankengama, nukunhwegelela tii nde.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pakiba nu munkege juna kitamwe cha ncholo kwa yaka komi nibena, <verse number="26" style="v"/>aganu kulaguligwa na akaganga ajingi. Nu kutumia uloi gwakwe gwoa, nambu alamitije na ali jakwe ngijibe mbaja. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Apajoa nhwalo gwa Yesu, na yene ngapekenyela pankengeni gwa bandu kunyuma ngakunyula ngobo yakwe, <verse number="28" style="v"/>ngawacha kumwojo, “Anda ngunywile tu ngobo jakwe, manama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ngakunyula lutando lwa Yesu, na myai jakwe ngijijoma kingobu ucho, na ngakibona mwene kutenda mmele gwakwe ulamiigwe mulilola lyakwe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kingobucho Yesu ngamanya kube makakala gammokite, yene ngabatendebuki bandu bala, ngakonya, “Beneke abakunywi ngobo yango?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe ngabannyanga, “Mmikulola bandu apabunhwegelile, mboni nkonya beneke abankunywile?” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngajendekea kulola ammone ojwatei genia. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio, ngamanya agampitile, yene ngaika kukilaya kwa mbwele, ngakilikatila, nu kulenga kweli. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu ngannenge jwenio, “Manango, imani jinu jinnamiye. Nnyabule kwa tengela, nname kitamwe chinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kingobu Yesu apakiba akalenga genia, bandu kuboka ku nyumba ja Yailo ngabaika nu kunnenge, “Mwana jwinu ajomwike. Ku nike kujendekea kachumbuya Aboli?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu ajalitije chibalongila, “Nambu ngannenge jwenio makajobokaje nhwamina tu.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu ajeketije kujenda na bandu bange nambu Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana, ununa gwa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ngabaikanga kachakwe Yailo, Yesu ngajoa manjega, nguto nu kokaleka kujingi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ngajingi unyumba, ngalenga, “Mboni manjega na nguto? Kamwale ajomwikije, atekugoche tu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Angweto ngubunhweka. Penia ngabapiyanga boa panja, nambu ngabakema awamundu mwana na amamundu na akinapunji bakwe atatu, ngabajingilanga kuchumbi omubabeka mmele gwa mwana jwenio. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ngankamu luboko, ngannenge, “Talitha, kumi,” mana gakwe, “Kamwale, nannenge, nnyimuke!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kingobucho ngajema nu kutumbu kutindi tindila. Akiba na yaka komi ni ibena. Kingobu pagapitila genia bandu ngabaomongwa muno. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabakelebuya kikobo chenie bakannenge munduje, na ngabalenge bampe chakulya.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanigwa kukilambo chuku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka paali penia ngabuja kachakwe, ngalongwana na akinapunji bakwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lichoba li Kupomalela ngatumbu kubola mu nyumba ji kungongalela. Bandu ajingi apabannyoa ngabaomongwa, ngabalenga, “Jwenio apatita ko malango aga? Genia malango nike? Na ibabo ikobo andi eyeye?” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bo, ojo nga jwajoje chalamalajo, mwana jwa Maliamu, na nkaka gwabe akina Yakobo na Yose na Yuda na Simoni? Bo, akalombo mundu nga batamanga upambaje? Penia ngababe na mbwele kwa genia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Nnondoli kupataje ichima kachakwe andaje kubandu bakwe, nambu kupata ichima kila paali.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Penia alaitije ikobo, nambu ngababeke maboko akatamwe ngabalamanga. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ngaomongwa magambu gwangaamini gwabe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu batumanga akinapunji komi na abena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Kuboka penia Yesu ngajenda kuijiji ya papipi na penia ngababola bandu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngabakema akinapunji komi na abena pamwe na ngabakinga abena abena. Ngabape kinala chu kubenga michepela, <verse number="8" style="v"/>ngabakelebuya, “Makapotoje kilebe chachoa mumwanja gwabe nambu bapotola bokola tu bakapotoje yakulya wala nkoba wala uloi muibwindo yabe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nkwindanga ilatu nambu makapotoje mikogo mibena.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Uyo ngalenga, “Papotipala pabapakumpokela, ntamanga upo mpaka apampakuboka penia. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Anda nhwike pikilambo na bakanite kumpokela andaje kumpenakia, mmokanga, penia mpyatanga litukunda mumakongono ginu kupala kachalakicha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuboka penia angweto ngababokanga penia ngabajenda kutaali na penia, ngabatangachanga Nhwalo Gwambone bandu ngabalapa mabaja gabe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngababenga michepela mijingi, ngabapakaya mauta akatamwe ajingi, ngabalamanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiu cha Yohana Mmatichi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nngwana Helode juku Galilaya ngajoa genia goa, gambu Yesu akajoanika kila paali. Bandu bange ngabalenga, “Yohana Mmatichi ate kuyoka, gambu makakala gi ikobo gabi nkati jakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bange ngabalenga, “Jwenio nga Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Bange ngabalenga, “Ojo nnondoli kati ja akalondoli ba lolo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kingobu Helode apajoa genia genie, ngalenga, “Ojo Yohana Mmatichi! Nga jununhweketa mutwe, ate kuyoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Machoba gu unyuma Helode akaamulicha kuntaba Yohana mukipungo. Helode atenda yene gambu gukutolana na Helodia ojwakiba nhwana gwa nnuna gwakwe Filipo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yohana mmatichi akate kunkelebuya Helode kulenga, “Ipaligwije kutola aanaba ununu gwinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio akatekunchimwa muno Yohana, ngapala kunkoma, nambu aotwije magambu annyogopa Nngwana Helodia. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Na Helode annyogopa Yohana Mmatichi magambu amanyi kutenda mundu jwenio jukiniaje kabe Nchwapi jwa Nnoongo, kabe ngammeka mulenda gwakwe. Helode ngapala kumpenakia Yohana, iganukube kuboka pa kumpenikia, ngaechuka muno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kiika kono Helodia ngapata kijemo. Likiba lichoba lya mpapala gu kombakela kubelekwa kwa Helode, ngababeke mpapala nkolongwa, bandu bakwe bi libalacha lyakwe na akolongwa ba akalenda bakwe na achikilongoi buku Galilaya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mwana jwakwe Helodia munkege ngajingila, ngaina, nganhwalali mwojo Helode na akageni mundu. Yene Nngwana Helode ngannenge kamwale, “Mikipala nike? Unyope nane manampa chachoa echimikipala.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kabe ngalagana kulenga, “Chachoa echimpala unyopatu, manumpage, ata nusu ji kingwana chango.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yene kamwale ngaboka, ngabakonya amamundu, “Nyopa nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Mutwe gwa Yohana mmatichi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kamwale jwenio ngabuja chokwe kangwana ngajopa, “Mbala umbe kingobu uchenje mutwe gwa Yohana mmatichi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yene angwana ngabaechuka muno, nambu kwa magambu ga kulapila kwabe, na kwa magambu akageni abakiba pampapala, baotwije kunkanalila. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yene nganhwamulicha nnenda alete mutwe gwa Yohana. Nnenda ngajenda mukipungo nganhweketa mutwe Yohana, <verse number="28" style="v"/>kuboka penia ngaleta mutwe mulichinia ngabampe kamwale, na jwenio ngabape amamundu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Akinapunji ba Yohana apabajoa genia, ngabaika ngabatola mmele gwa Yohana ngabachika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aupe chakulya nkengeni nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Achandundame ngababuja, nukongana na Yesu, ngabalenge goa agabateile nu kubola. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Penia pakiba na bandu ajingi abajenda nu kubuja kwa Yesu na akinapunji bakwe baotwije kulye chakulya yene Yesu ngabalenge angweto, “Tujende paali pantemela kwenio tukaba jika jito mamakapomolela kachoko.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yene angweto ngabajendanga jikajabe muntumbwi paali pantemela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi ngababona angweto pababokanga, yene ngabamanya kingobu ucho kababilingite, ajingi kuboka kila kilambo, ngababutakilanga ngabalongelela kuika kwenio kwajenda Yesu na akinapunji bakwe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kingobu Yesu apauluka muntumbwi, ngaubona nkengeni gwa bandu, ngababone kia, magambu bakibanga andi mambelele ganga nchungi. Yene ngatumbu kabola ilebe ijingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pilitipika lichoba, akinapunji bakwe ngaba nnyendelela Yesu, ngabannenge, “Paali pamba papongote, na ngoe kutipike. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mbaya matabukange bandu maleke bajendange kumigonda nu kuijiji ya papipi, bakaemelange ilyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabalengela, “Mapagange mangweto chakulya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Akinapunji ngabankonya Yesu, “Bo, mpala tujende takaemele mikate ku uloi ndu, na kapeganga balyagange?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yene Yesu ngabakonyanga, “Nkweti mikate milenga? Nnyende makalolange.”</para>
  <para style="p">Apabalola, ngabannenge, “Jibi mikate nhwano na yamaki ibena.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Penia, Yesu ngabalenge akinapunji bakwe matamikange bandu boa ikuta ikuta pina manyai ga chwapi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yene bandu ngabatamanga ikuta ikuta ya bandu mia mia na ya bandu amsini amsini. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngatola mikate nhwano na yamaki ibele, ngalola kunani kumbengu, nu kunnumba Nnoongo. Ngametula mikate, na kape akinapunji bakwe babaganakie bandu. Uyo na yamaki ibele ngababaganakia boa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabalye, nu kujukuta. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Penia akinapunji gabalokotanga imbolopolo yi mikate na yamaki, ngabatweleyanga ikapo komi ni ibena. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Bandu abalile mikate jenie bakiba akinalome elufu nhwano.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda panani ja mache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe bajingi muntumbwi, balongalele kujenda ku Betisaida, kwie ja lilaba likolongwa, kingobu chenie ngabanneka akatabuka bandu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kuboka pa katabuka bandu ngajenda kukitombi kugongalela. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Piika kimuyo, ntumbwi gwakiba panakati ji lilaba likolongwa, Yesu akiba kujomo jika jakwe. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ngaba bonanga akinapunji bakwe bakalaganga kwa kuputa makasia, gambu upepo uuma kubajenda. Papipi nu kuche, Yesu ngabajendelela akinapunji akajenda panani ja mache. Apala kapetanga, <verse number="49" style="v"/>nambu angweto ngabammona akajenda panani ja mache. Ngabawacha nu kuchobela, “Ele lihoka!” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Boa apabammona ngabajogopa muno.</para>
  <para style="p">Kingobucho Yesu ngalonge nabo, “Nkotokange, nenga. Makajogopangaje!” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngaombela muntumbwi omubakiba akinapunji bakwe na upepo ngukotoka. Akinapunji ngabaomongwa muno, <verse number="52" style="v"/>bakibanga tango kumanya mana ga mikateje. Gambu malango gabe gakiba gapunganikwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamianga akatamwe Kugenesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayo 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Ngabajomboka lilaba, ngabaika kukilambo cha ku Genesaleti, ngaba jemekanga ntumbwi gwabe. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kingobutu apabapita mumtumbwi bandu ngabammanya Yesu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Bai, ngabatindila chokwe kukilambo choa, kila abannyoa kutenda Yesu abi kwako ngabampelekela akatamwe bagonike mumakai gabe. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kila paali Yesu apajenda, kukijiji na kunnyini andaje kumigonda, bandu ngaba bekanga akatamwe pulubanja, ngabannyopa Yesu bakunyule ati lubiniko lwa ngobo jakwe. Benia boa abankunywile ngabalama.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Maboulo ga akinanhota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayo 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafalisayo gange na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngagaika kuboka Kuyelusalemu ngabakongana nnongi ja Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngababona bange akinapunji bakwe bakalya mikate panga kuya maboko andi apagalenga maboulo ga akinanhota babe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwa magambu Mafalisayo na Akayahudi boa bakengama maboulo ga akinanhota, kulyeje kilebe mpaka ukuya maboko mpaka muiwewe, <verse number="4" style="v"/>kabe, kulyegangaje kilebe chachoa kuboka kuchoko, mpaka kukijeleya oti. Kubi na malagilo gange gababoligwe kutumbu lolo kujeleya ikombe, yupalia na yombo ya liaba na indanda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabankonya Yesu, “Bo mboni akinapunji binu ukengamaje maboulo agabutulagile akinanhota bito, nambu balye pangakuya maboko?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Kube nnondoli Isaya annondola kweli! Makangweto makandendemundu, paandika,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Nnoongo alenga, bandu aba bannyali kwa malobe tu,</para>
  <para style="q">nambu myojo jabe jibi kutaali nane.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kung'ongalela kwabe kwambonije,</para>
  <para style="q">mana ilebe ibabolana nga malagilo ga bandu tu,</para>
  <para style="q">benia bakitanga gangonenga!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Magweto mijileka amuli ja Nnoongo nu kugajali maboulo ga bandu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulongela, “Mangweto kupunganikwa ukana Malagilo ga Nnoongo gambu gu ukengama maboulo ginu! <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gambu Musa ngaamulicha, ‘Maichimu awabinu na amabinu,’ Na ‘Ojubatukana awamundu andaje amamundu, mpaka akomigwe?’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nambu mangwetumwe mmolanga yene, ‘Anda mudu akweti kilebe chakape awamundu andaje amamundu, nambu alenga kilebe chenie Kolibani, mana gakwe chikipangigwe ku Nnoongo, <verse number="12" style="v"/>bai, apaligwaje kabe kape awamundu andaje amamundu.’ <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yenie nga pamilibembula lilobe lya Nnoongo magambu gwa maboulo gammolana. Kabe gabi gange majingi agantendanga andi genia.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ilebe immengwa mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayo 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu ngaukema kabele nkengeni gwa bandu, ngaulengela, “Umbenekiange mmoa, na mmanyange. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kibije kilebe echikijingi nkati ja mundu kuboka panja echikiotola kummeka mundu kube mmaja. Nambu echikipita nkati ja mundu nga echikimmeka mundu mumalemwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Juna machikilo gukujoa ajoe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apauleka nkengeni gwa bandu nu kujingi unyumba, akinapunji bakwe ngaba nkonyanga mana ja kulandanakia kwenio. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Bo, namangwetumwe mmanyangitije? Bo, mmanyangitije kutenda kilebe chikinnyingi mundu kuboka panja, kuotwaje kummeka mundu kube mmaja, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kwa magambu chenie kijingi mumwojoje, nambu mulutumbo, nu kuboka penia kipita panja kucholo?” Kwa kulenga nyenie, Yesu ngaijeguya ilyo yoa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngajendekea kulenga, “Echikipita nkati ja mundu ngechikimmeka mundu mumalemwa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Magambu kuboka nkati ja mundu, mumwojo gwa mundu, gaboka mawacho mabaja na ngongola na bwii na ukoma, <verse number="22" style="v"/>ngongola na chojo na ubaja na uwangi na upichadi na bwiu na matukano na kupungwanikwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ilebe yenie ibaja yoa iboka nkati ja mundu, na yammeka mundu, kube mmaja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Imani ja munkege jumwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayo 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka paali penia, ngajenda kukilambo chu Kutilo. Kwenio ngajingila munyumba jimwe na apaije mundu amanye, nambu aotwije kukiiya. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Munkege ojwakiba na nhwenja juna nchepela, ngajoa nhwalo gwa Yesu. Ngaika kwa Yesu ngakilekela pae ja makongono gakwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio akiba Mgiliki, kabila jakwe Mfoinike ku Silia. Ngannyopa Yesu ammoye mwana jwakwe nchepela. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngajanga, “Tuipe oti chakulya ingota. Ipaligweje chakulya cha ingota nu kiilekele imbwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Munkege jwenio ngabajanga, “Angwana, nambu ata imbwa eibi nhwina mwa mecha kulye imbolopolo yi ingota.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Kwa magambu ga lilobe lyenie, nnyabu kachinu, kwenio mankolela nhwenja gwinu nchepela gummokite!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ngajabula kachakwe, ngankolela nhwenja gwakwe agolwike pikindanda, na kweli nchepela gummokite.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia bubu jwanga joa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngaboka kilambo cha Tilo, ngapetela ku Sidoni ngaika kulilaba likolongwa lya ku Galilaya kwa kupetela kilambo cha Dekapoli. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bandu bange ngaba nnete mundu ojwakiba bubu jwangajoa, ngabannyopa Yesu ammeke maboko. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu ngammoya pankengeni gwa bandu, ngammeka ngonji mumachikilo, ngauna mata na ngankamu lulimi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngalola kunani kumbengu, ngaechuka, “Efatha,” mana gakwe “Nnyogoke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kingobucho mundu jwenio ngaotola kujoa, kitata chakwe ngichammoka, ngaotola kulongela chwapi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu ngaba amulichanga bakannengeje mundu nhwalo gwenio, nambu apabakelebuya bakalongeje, ngapabalongela muno. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bao abajoine ngabaomongwa muno. Ngabaomwanga ngabalenga, “Atei goa chwapi, bapi kindimba bangajoa kujoa, na bubu kulongela!”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapaganga ilyo bandu elufu ncheche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayo 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie, bandu ajingi ngabakongana kabele. Bandu benia bakwetangitije chakulya, Yesu ngabakema akinapunji bakwe, ngabalengelanga, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Nabonelanga kia bandu aba kwa magambu bakibanga na nenga kwa machoba matatu, wala bakwetangitije chakulya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Anda nalekangite bajabulange kachabe kongo babi na njala bapakuinduka undela, gambu katijabe babokangite kutaali.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe Yesu ngabankonya, “Pamba tubi papongoti mundu apata koo chakulya chukujukuta bandu boaba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya, “Nkwetingite mikate milenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga “Mikate saba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bai, ngabaamulicha bandu batamange pae. Ngajitola mikate saba jela, ngannumba Nnoongo, ngametula, ngabape akinapunji bakwe babaganakiye bandu, nabombe ngababagananikia. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bombe uyo bakibanga na yamaki njoko. Yesu ngajilumbila, na kalenge akinapunji bakwe jibaganigwe kwa bandu unyae. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bandu ngabalye, nukujukuta. Ngabalokota imbolopolo ngitwele ikapo saba. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bandu abalilangita bakiba elufu ncheche. Yesu ngabatabuka bandu na kaleka bajabule, <verse number="10" style="v"/>na kingobu ucho ngaombela muntumbwi pamwe na akinapunji bakwe, ngajenda kukilambo cha Dalimanuta.</para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo bapalanga ikobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-48">Matayo 12:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bange Mafalisayo ngabannyendele Yesu, ngabatumbu kutaukana nakwe. Ngabapala kuntega, kunyenie ngabannyopa alaye iingi yu kumbengu kutenda Nnoongo annyeketile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngaechuka umwojo, ngalenga, “Mboni bandu bangoe bapala iingi yi ikobo? Nannenge kweli, lungolo londo lupataje iingi yi ikobo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalekanga, ngaombe kabele mu ntumbwi, nu kutumbu kujomboka kwie ja lilaba likolongwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Manjachala ga Mafalisayo na ga Helode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayo 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Akinapunji bate kulibalila kupoto mikate mijingi, bakiba na nkate gumwe tu mu ntumbwi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji, “Ntamanga maha! Mmaganga mio na amila ja Mafalisayo na amila ja Helode.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabatumbu konyana benakangweto, “Balenga genia kwa magambu tukwetije nkate gwagwoa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngamanya genia agabalengelana, yene ngabakonya, “Mboni nkonyana nhwalo gwangakola mikate? Bo, mmanyangiteje tango? Mawacho ginu matopeu? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bo, nkwetingite mio na mmi kulolangaje? Nkwetingite machikilo na kujoje? Bo, mmikombakelaje, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kingobu apanametula mikate nhwano kape bandu elufu nhwano? Ngankongolanga ikapo ilenga ya imbolopolo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Komi na ibena.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu ngakonya kabele, “Apanametula mikate saba jela na kape bandu elufu ncheche, ngankongolanga ikapo ilenga ya imbolopolo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Saba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ngabakonya, “Tango manamanyangaje?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia mundu jwangalola jwa Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ngabaika ku Betisaida, kwenio bandu bange ngabanneta mundu jwangalola kwa Yesu, ngaba nnyopa ankunyule. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngankamula luboko jwangalola jwenio, ngampeleka kumbeto ja kijiji. Kuboka pa kunhuni mata mumio gakwe, Yesu ngammeka maboko panani jakwe ngankonya, “Bo, nhwotwile kukibona kilebe chachoa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mundu jwenio ngalola ngalenga, “Elo, nhotwi kabona bandu, nambu babonekana anda mikongo ejijenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu ngammekela kabele maboko panani pamio. Ngoe mundu jwenio ngakacha mio, mio gakwe ngagaekuka, ngalola kila kilebe gwicho. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ngannenge ajabule kachakwe nu kunkelebuya, “Makabujaje kukijiji!”</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo annyekete Yesu kube Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu na akinapunji bakwe ngabajenda kuijiji papipi na ku Kaisalia ja Kufilipi. Undela, Yesu ngabakonya akinapunji bakwe, “Bandu balenga nenga na beneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ngabannyanga, “Bange balenga mwenga nga Yohana Mmatichi, bange Eliya na bange jumwe kati ja akalondoli ba Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya, “Na mangweto bo, nnenga nenga nabeneke?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo ngajanga, “Mwenga nga Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngabakelebuya makannenge munduje minhalo jango.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alenga nhwalo gwa kupotekigwa kwakwe na kiu chakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu ngatumbu kabola akinapunji bakwe, “Mwana jwa Mundu mpaka apotekigwe muno nu ukanigwa na akinanhota, akakung'i akolongwa na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa. Makomigwa, nambu lichoba lya tatu mayoka.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela nhwalo gwenio panga iya. Penia, Petulo ngantola pantemela, ngatumbu kunkalapila. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngatendebuka, ngaba lolekea akinapunji bakwe, ngankalapila Petulo ngalenga, “Mmoke nnongi jango Malichetani! Mawacho ginu gaboka ku Nnoongoje nambu ga bandu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngaukema nkengeni gwa bandu pamwe na akinapunji bakwe, ngabalengela, “Anda mundu jwajwoa jola apala kube napunji jwango, mpakaoti akikane mwene, na apotole nchalaba gwakwe, angengame. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Gambu mundu jwajoa ojwapala kukombola bwomi gwakwe mwene, mauoya, nambu mundu ojwaoya bwomi gwakwe kwa magambu gango nenga na kwa magambu ga Nhwalo Gwambone, maukombola. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mundu apata nike anda ajipatite dunia joa nu kuoya bwomi gwakwe? Kibije! <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kibije kilebe echibaotwi kupanga gambu gwa bwomi gwakwe. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Anda mundu amone oni nenga na maboulo gango mulungolo londo lwanga nnyali Nnoongo, Mwana jwa Mundu ammonela oni mundu jwenio, mangobu apapakuika mukibumo cha Awamundu pamwe na akapakachi ba Chwapi ba Nnoongo.”</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngajendekea kulenga, “Nannenge kweli, babi bange upamba bawegangaje panga kukibona Kingwana cha Nnoongo chakaika kwa makakala.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agalambuka kumiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kuboka pa machoba sita, Yesu ngabatolanga Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana kunani ja kitombi kitandamau jika jabe. Apabajendekea kulola, Yesu ngagalambuka kumiyo nnongi jabe, <verse number="3" style="v"/>ngobo yakwe nging'ala, ngibe nhuu mbuu, kupeta mundu jwajoa jola padunia ojwaotwi kupula. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Penia akinapunji akatatu ngabammona Eliya na Musa bakalongela na Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Petulo ngannenge Yesu, “Aboli, chwapi twenga tube pamba. Mbaya tuchenge iteba itatu, chimwe chinu na chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jwombe nakajakwe ngabajogopa ata akimanyije chu kulongela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngilipitila liunde ngilyawekelela nikiwili chakwe, ni lilobe ngilijoanika kuboke kuliunde, “Jwenio nga Manango ojunampala, mampenakiange!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kingobu ucho akinapunji benia ngabalola tii, nambu bammwenije mundu jonge, nambu Yesu jikajakwe tu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Apabauluka pikitombi, Yesu ngabakelebuya “Makannengeje mundu jwajwoa ikobo eimibweni, mpaka Mwana jwa Mundu apapakuyoka kuboka kwa abawile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ngibiliagabala lilagilo lyenie, nambu ngabakonyana bene akangweto, “Mana gakwe ni kuyoka kuboka kwa abawile” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na ngabankonya Yesu, “Mboni akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa balenga mpaka oti Eliya aike?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Eliya atenda kuika kubeka ilebe yoa telatela. Uyo, kunike bai iandikigwe Mumajandiko Gachwapi kutenda Mwana jwa Mundu abakupotekigwa muno nu ukanigwa? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nannenge, Eliya aike, nabandu ngabantenda pabapalanga andi Majandiko apagalenga nhwalo gwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia kakombo juna nchepela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Apabaikanga kwa akinapunji bange bala, ngabaubona nkengeni nkolongwa gwa bandu penia. Na akaboli bange ba Malagilo ga Musa bakiba bakataukana nabo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kingobu bandu apabammona Yesu, boa ngaba nhwomwanga muno, ngabammutakila bampate abali. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya akinapunji bakwe, “Ntaukana nike nangweto?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mundu jumwe pankenga gwenio ngajanga, “Aboli, Nannetite manango kwinu, akweti nchepela ogummeka akaotoje kulongela. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kila kingobu apanhwikilila, kung'wiya pae nu kupita liululu nkano, nu kuyagamino nu kube nnyomo mmele gwoa. Nganajopa akinapunji binu buboyange nchepela gwenio nambu baotolingije.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Mangweto mabandu banga imani! Ndama namangweto mpaka lii? Nanhwimbilila mpaka lii? Mannetange mwano pamba!” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngabampeleka jwenio kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Kingobutu nchepela apaumona Yesu, ngugunng'wia kakombo jwenio pamakongono gakwe, ngagwe pae, ngagalabuka nu kupita liuluulu munkano. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya awamundu, “Kutumbu li apatakine ni ilebe andi yenieye?”</para>
  <para style="p">Benia ngabajanga, “Tangu pakiba mwana.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Mangobu majingi nchepela upala kunkoma kung'wiki pamwoto nu umache, kupala unkome. Anda nhwotwile, mutubone kia nu mutukole!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Kwanike nnengite anda nhwotwile! Kila kilebe kube kwa mundu ojwaamine.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Awawa benia kingobu ucho ngabaguta kanonoya, “Ngweti imani, nambu tegategaje. Unyalie mbe na imani ngolongwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu apababona bandu ajingi bakajonjekea kuika nnongi jakwe, ngaukalapila nchepela gwenio. “Nchepela mamantenda mwana ojo kube bubu na jwangajoa, nunhwamulicha, mummoke jonjo na makanyingi kabeje!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Penia nchepela gwenio nguchobela, ngung'wia kakombo jwenio pae, kubokapenia ngugummoka. Kakombo jola gabonekana anda ntui, na kila mundu ngalenga, “Awile!” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngankamu luboko, nganyinula, na jwenio ngajema.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kuboka pa Yesu kujabu kachakwe, akinapunji bakwe ngabankonya kuntemela, “Mboni twe tuotwije kuuboya nchepela?” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Michepela aina jenie kubokaje kindema nambu kukunng'ongalela Nnoongo tu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alenga kabele unhwalo gwa kiu chakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu na akinapunji bakwe ngababoka penia na ngabajabulanga ku Galilaya. Yesu apaije bandu bamanye okwakiba, <verse number="31" style="v"/>magambu akiba akabola akinapunji bakwe, Kulengela, “Mwana jwa Mundu mabankamuya kwa bandu na benia mabankomanga, nambu lichoba lya tatu kuboka pu komigwa mayoka kube mmomi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu akinapunji bamanyangitije mana ga maboulo genia, ngabajogopa kunkonya.</para>
  <para style="s">Nkolongwa meneke?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ngabaikanga ku Kafalanaumu, na apakiba ukaja, ngaba konyanga akinapunji bakwe, “Ntaukana nike pamakibanga undela mola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nambu angweto bannyangangiteje, magambu undela bakiba bakataukana akolongwa beneke kati jabe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ngatama pae, ngabakema akinapunji komi na abele, ngabalengela, “Mundu andapaile kube jwa kutumbula mpaka oti akibeke mwene kube unyuma ja bowa na kube mpakachi jwa bowa.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Penia ngantola mwana nchokochoko, ngannyemeka nnongi jabe. Ngankumbatila, na ngabalenge angweto, <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Abampoke mwana andi jonjo ku liina lyango, bamboke nenga, na abamboke nenga, bamboke ne tuje, nambu uyo bampoke na jwajo ojwandumite.”</para>
  <para style="s">Jwanga tugaluka abi upandi gwito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yohana ngannenge Yesu, “Aboli, tumweni mundu jumwe akajiboya michepela kwa liina linu, na twenga ngutunkanakia magambu jwenio abi pamweje natwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngalenga, “Makankanakiangaje,” Gambu abije mundu ojwatenda ikobo ku liina lyango, nu upopo kulenga mabaja kwango nenga. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Gambu jwangatugaluka twenga abi upandi gwito. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli mundu jwajwoa ojwampeganga kikombe cha mache gukunywe magambu mangweto mabandu bango ne Kilisto Nkomboi, mmanya apelelwaje kupoke hupo yakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Ipengu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Jwajwoa ojwapa kunnyambukia jumwe jwa akachoko kujileka imani jakwe kwango nenga, yakabi mbaya kwa mundu jwenio kuntabalila muntandala gwakwe libwe likolongwa lya kuyagila nu kunnekela mubaali. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Anda luboko lwinu lummeke mumalemwa, mulunhekete! Mbaya mwe kujingila mubwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela panga luboko, kupeta kube na maboko mabele na kujenda kujahanamu, kumwoto gwangaimika machoba goa. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mwenio, mbeku yakwe kuweje na mwoto gwakwe kuimikaje. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Na lukongono lwinu lumpelie kujileka imani jinu, mulunhekete! Mbaya kujingila mubwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela panga lukongono, kuliko kube na makongono goa mabele nu kulekeligwa kumwoto gwangaimika machoba goa. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mwenio, ‘Mbeku yakwe kuweje na mwoto gwakwe kuimikaje.’ <verse number="47" style="v"/>Na lio linu anda lyannemukie kujioya imani jinu, miliboye! Mbaya kujingila Mukingwana cha Nnoongo na lio limwe, kuliko kube na mio goa mabele na kunnekela kumwoto gwangaimika machoba goa. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mwenio ‘mbeku yakwe kuweje, na mwoto gwakwe kuimikaje.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Kila mundu majeguigwa kwa mwoto andi lilumbo pilijeguligwa kwa mwinyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>“Mwinyo chwapi, nambu andauoite kulaa kwakwe, maijonjekeigwa na nike?</para>
  <para style="p">“Mmegange na mwinyo gu kujeguya nkati jinu, nu kutama kutengela kati jinu.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu abola nhwalo gwa kutolana na kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngaboka penia ngajenda kukilambo cha Yudea, kwie ja lukemba Yolidani. Bandu ajingi ngaba nnyendelela kabele, jwombe ngababola kabele anda patenda machoba goa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Gange Mafalisayo ngagannyendela, ngagajiga kuntega ngagankonya, “Bo, ipaligwe analome kaleka aanamundu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga kukonya, “Musa ampilingite malagilo gani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Angweto ngabajanga, “Musa alenga analome baotwi kaandiki talaka aanamundu na kaleka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu gabalengela, “Musa anhwandikila malagilo genia magambu gu kujundupa kwa myojo jinu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambu apaitumbula, kupanganigwa dunia, ‘Nnoongo apangana munulome na munkege,’ Anda pagalenga Majandiko Gachwapi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Kwa magambu genie mundu baleka awamundu na amamundu, aba pamwe na aanamundu, <verse number="8" style="v"/>benia baba bamwe.’ Nayene benia abena kabeje nambu mmele gumwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Abije mundu ojwaotwile kukilekania Nnoongo echalondine pamwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apabajingila kabele unyumba, akinapunji bakwe ngabankonya Yesu unhwalo gwa kile chenie. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ngabalengela, “Mundu ojwanneka nhwanamundu nu kutola jonge munkege antende ngongola nhwanamundu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu uyo, akege ababaleka angwanamundu nu kutolana na bange batende ngongola angwanamundu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ailumika ingota ichoko ichoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bandu bange ngabannetela Yesu ingota ichoko ichoko aibeke maboko, nambu akinapunji ngabakanakia. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kingobu Yesu pagabona genia, ngachimwa na ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Mileke ingota yene iike kwango, mikiikanakiaje, magambu Kingwana cha Nnoongo nga magambu ga bandu ababi andi ingota yenje. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli kutenda mundu jwajotijola jwangapokela Kingwana cha Nnoongo anda mwana ajingije mwenio.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Penia ngaitola ingota mukuboko jakwe, ngaibeke maboko, ngailumika.</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu juna uloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu apatumbula kabele mwanja gwakwe, mundu jumwe ngammutakila mbelo, ngakilikitila majugwa nnongi jakwe, ngankonya, “Aboli mambone, ndendabole mbate bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu ngankonya, “Mboni mwe ungema nambone? Abije jwambone nambu Nnoongo jika jakwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Magamanyi Malagilo, ‘Makakomaje, makabe na ngongolaje, makajibaje, makapia uchaili gwa uangije, makakoloyaje, majoe awawa binu na amabinu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Jwombe ngalenga, “Aboli, genia goa nagaagabile tango apanakiba nakakombo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu ngannolekea, ngampala, ngannengela, “Nnibalile kilebe chimwe. Nnyende makauche kila kilebe echinkweti, nu uloi gwenio makape akaocho, na mwe mma nankoba kumbengu, kubokapenia nhwike ungengame.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mundu jola pagajoa genia, ngabeka ngenja kumio jakwe, ngajabula kachakwe achimwite, magambu akiba nuloi muno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalolake tii akinapunji bakwe na kalenge, “Maiba kujundupa ku bandu bina uloi kujingila Mukingwana cha Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabaomongwa na malobe gakwe, nambu Yesu ngajendekea kulongela, “Machabanango, kujundupa mundu juna uloi kujingi Mukingwana cha Nnoongo! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kujundupa muno ku mundu juna uloi kujingila Mukingwana cha Nnoongo ibi kindema muno ngamia kupeta pililanga lya chingana.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="10:25">Ngamia</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Akinapunji bakwe ngabaomongwa muno ngabakonyana, “Nga meneke ojwapakuoto ukomboka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalolakeya, ngabajanga, “Kwa bandu kilebe chenje kuwechakanaje, nambu ku Nnoongo ilebe yoa kuwechakana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petulo ngannengela, “Nnole, twenga tuilekite ilebe ito yoa, tunkengime mwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Elo, nannenge yene, kila mundu jwajoa ojwajilekite nyumba andaje akakolo andaje akalombo andaje amama andaje awawa andaje ingota andaje migonda kwa magambu gangone na kwa magambu ga Nhwalo Gwambone, <verse number="30" style="v"/>mampokela mala pa mia ngoe. Nyumba na akaka na alombo na amama ningota ni migonda pamwe na kupotekigwa, na mangobu agaika mampata bwomi gwa machoba goa pangapela. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nambu bandu ajingi ababi ngoe bukutumbula mababa bukujomolela, na ajingi ababi ngoe bukujomolela mababa bukutumbula.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alenga patatu unhwalo gwa kiu chakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu na akinapunji bakwe akiba undela kujenda kukilambo cha Kuyelusalemu. Yesu ngabalongelela akinapunji bakwe, na akinapunji bakwe ngababeganga na mbwele, na bandu abakengima ngabajogopa. Yesu ngabatola kabele akinapunji bakwe komi na abele umbwega, ngatumbu kalengela gaga agapakumpata. <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Mpenakiange! Tujenda Kuyelusalemu, na kwenio Mwana jwa Mundu bapankamuya kwa akakung'i akolongwa na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa. Benia bapakunhukumula akomigwe na kunkamuya kwa bandu banga Akayahudi, <verse number="34" style="v"/>benia mabantenda nhwenyo, nukunhuni mata, bapakumputa iboko nu kunkoma, nambu lichoba li itatu mayoka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kujopa kwa Yakobo na Yohana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayo 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yakobo na Yohana, ingota ya Zebedayo, ngabannyendele Yesu. Ngabannenge, “Aboli, tupala mututende kilebe chitupakunnyopa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya, “Mpala nantendelange nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ngabannyanga, “Apampakutama pikitebu chinu chi kibumo chi Kingwana, tujopa mwe mutupe tutame namwenga, jumwe kingonu chinu cha kalelo na jonge kingonu cha kangeja.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Mikimanyije echinnyopanga. Nhwotolinge kunywe kikombe cha kupotekigwa echimbaligwa kunywe? Unhwechangite kubatichigwa anda apambakubatigwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ngabajanga, “Tuotwile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabalengela, “Kweli nhwotwile kunywela kikombe echimbakunywela nu kubatichigwa kundela ejimbakubatichwa. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nambu nenga ngwetije amuli ja kuchagula beneke abapakutama kalelo andaje kangeja. Nambu Nnoongo ojwapakape paali pennia kwa abachaguligwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Akinapunji bange komi pabajoa genia, ngabatumbu kachimwa Yakobo na Yohana. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakemanga boa pamwe, ngabalengela, “Mmanyi kutenda abawachigwa kube akatawala ba dunia batawalanga kwa makakala bandu babe na akiilongoi babe bina makakala makolongwa kwa bandu bena. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nambu mangwetomwe ikabe yeneje. Nambu mundu ojwapala kube nkolongwa panakati jinu abe oti mpakachi jwa mmoa, <verse number="44" style="v"/>ojwapala kube jukutumbula panakati jinu, mpaka oti abe mmanda jwa boa. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Gambu Mwana jwa Mundu aikikutumikigwaje, ila kutumikia, na kuboya bwomi gwakwe kube ukombola kwa bandu ajingi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annamia jwangalola Batimayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ngabaikanga ku Yeliko, Yesu na akinapunji bakwe pamwe na bandu ajingi apabakiba bakaboka kukilambo chenie, jwangalola jumwe nnyopi ojwakonda liina lyakwe Batimayo mwana jwa Timayo akiba atamite umbwega ja ndela. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Apajoa kutenda nga Yesu juku Nazaleti, ngatumbula kuchobela, “Yesu! Mwana jwa Daudi! Umone kia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi ngabankalapila akotoke. Nambu jwombe ngayangala kuchobela, “Mwana jwa Daudi umone kia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu ngajema ngalenga, “Mankemange.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabankemanga jwangalola jwenio. Ngabannenge, “Nnimbe mwojo!” “Nnyeme, atenda nkema mwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Jwombe ngalekela lutando lwakwe, ngaomba kunani, ngannyendele Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu ngankonya, “Mpala nantende nike?”</para>
  <para style="p">Jwangalola jwenio ngajanga, “Aboli, nyopa nhoto kulola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu ngannengela, “Nnyende, imani jinu jinnamie.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kingobu tu jwangalola jwenio ngaotola kulola, na ngankengama Yesu undela.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajingi Kuyelusalemu ku kuilulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Apabakiba bakabandakila Kuyelusalemu, papipi na kilambo cha Betifage na Betania, ngabaika Pikitombi cha Mizeituni. Yesu ngabatuma akinapunji bakwe abele balongelele, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ngabalengela, “Nnyendange kukijiji echikibi nnongi jinu. Apampakujingi mwenio, mamankolela mwana jwa liponda ajigiligwe, jwombe tango anaombaligwaje na mundu. Mankulugule mannetange. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Anda mundu ankonyangite, mboni ntendanga nyenela, mannengela, bilipala Angwana na mabilibuya kingobu chenje.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ngabajabula, ngabankolela mwana liponda undela bantabali paniango gwa nyumba. Apabakiba pabankulugula, <verse number="5" style="v"/>bange bandu abakiba bajemangite penia ngabakonya, “Mboni mankulugula mwana liponda jwenio?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabajanga anda Yesu apabalengalinge, na bandu benia ngabaleka bajabulange. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngabampelekela Yesu mwana liponda jwenio, ngabatandikanga ngobo yabe panani ja mwana liponda jwenio na Yesu ngatama panani jakwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi ngabatandika ngobo yabe undela, na kongo bange ngabatema matutwe mumigonda ngabajala undela. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bandu abakiba nnongi jakwe na abakengima unyuma jakwe, ngabakwaja kulilobe likolongwa kulenga, “Alumbigwe Nnoongo! Nnoongo ampe kindimba ojwapakuika ku liina lya Angwana! <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kibe ni kindimba kingwana chikipakuika cha awabito ana Daudi. Alumbigwe Nnoongo kunani kumbengu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu paika Kuyelusalemu, ngajenda ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo, ngalola kila kilebe ku kuingakia. Nambu kwa magambu jakiba kimuyo, ngajabula ku Betania pamwe na akinapunji bakwe komi na abena.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aulaani nkoju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayo 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Malabu jakwe, apabakiba bakaboka ku Betania, Yesu ngabe na njala. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngaubona kutaali nkongo ntini guna maamba majingi. Ngaujendelela alole anda ubi na ngoko yayoa. Nambu apuwikalila, ngaukolela upambikeje ila maamba jika, kwa magambu gwakiba tango mangobu ga kupambika. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu ngaulenge ntini, “Kuboka lele na machoba goa abije mundu ojwapakulye ngokwa kwinu mwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">Akinapunji bakwe ngabajoanga malobe genia.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apabaikanga Kuyelusalemu, Yesu ngaika ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo na ngatumbu kabenga bandu abakiba bakaucha nu kuemela ilebe mwenio. Ngapendengulana mecha ya bandu abakiba bakajangangana uloi, ni itebu ya bandu abakiba bakaucha njeba, <verse number="16" style="v"/>na Yesu annekiteje mundu atole kilebe pulubanja lwa nyumba ja Nnoongo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngababolanga bandu, “Ijandikigwe mu Majandiko Nnoongo alengite, ‘Nyumba jango jikemigwa nyumba ja kugongalela kwa bandu ba ilambo yoa.’ Nambu mangweto mujitei kube nduka ja akabwii!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa apabajoa genia, ngabatumbu kupala ndela ja kunkoma Yesu. Nambu ngabannyogopa, magambu bandu ajingi batenda kuomongwa maboulo gakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apiika kimuyo, Yesu na akinapunji bakwe ngababoka pannyini.</para>
  <para style="s">Maboulo kuboke kwa nkongo gwa ngokwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayo 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Malabo jakwe kilokilo, apabakiba bakapeta undela, ngububona nkongo ntini gola, unyalite gwoa maamba mpaka mikega. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petulo ngaukombakela, ngannenge Yesu, “Aboli, nnole, nkongo ntini ogumubekita nhwilo gola, ujomite!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Munhwamini Nnoongo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nannenge kweli kutenda, Mundu anda akilengile kitombi chenje, ‘Nnyikuke makatumbukile kubaali, panga mbwele kumwojo gwakwe,’ Nambu aamini kutenda ilebe yoa eyalongela, Nnoongo maitenda. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Magambu genia nannenge mangweto, apang'ongalela nukujopa chochoa ku Nnoongo, nhwamini kutenda mpatite. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apannyemanga kugongale ku Nnoongo, mannekekeye kila mundu ojwannemwite chachoa, ibe Awawa binu ababi kumbengu bannekekeya malemwa ginu.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nambu panga alekekeya bange, ata Awabinu ababi kumbengu banekekeyaje mangweto malemwa ginu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukonyana unhwalo gwa uwecho gwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ngabaikanga kabele Kuyelusalemu. Yesu apakiba akajenda ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo, akakung'i akolongwa na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na akananhota ngabannyendela, <verse number="28" style="v"/>ngabankonya, “Ntenda ile yenie kukinala gani? Bene abampi kinala chenie?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Na nenga mbakunkonya kilebe, anda unyangangite, na nenga nannyanga ndenda ikobo yenje kukinala gani. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Unengele, uwecho gwa Yohana gukubaticha uboka kumbengu, andaje uboka kubandu?” Unyangange.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ngabatumbu kutaukana, “Tulengabo? Anda tulengite, ‘Kuboka ku mbengu,’ alenga, ‘Mboni, munhwaminingije Yohana?’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nambu anda tulengite, ‘Ubokita kubandu.’ ” Bajogopa bandu ajingi gambu boa baamininge kutenda Yohana akiba kweli nnondoli jwa Nnoongo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ngabannyanga Yesu, “Tumanyije.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngabalengela, “Nane uyo nannengeje ngamwa ilebe yenje kukinala gani.”</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa akibalua ba nng'onda gwa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ngalonge nabo kwa kulandanakia, “Mundu jumwe ngalema nng'onda gwa mizabibu, ngalitindikia ubego, ngaemba libomba lya ukamangi zabibu, na ngachenga kilendo. Ngabajaika akibalua bange na ngajenda mwanja kukilambo cha kutaali.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="12:1">Bandu abena bakamanga zabibu mulibomba liukamangi divai</figure> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mangobu ga mauno, ngabankinga mmanda jwabe kwa akalemi, akatolele lipungu lyabe lya mauno li munng'onda gwabe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Akalemi benia ngabampukila, ngabamputa, ngabammuyanga utopo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ngankinga kabele mmanda jonge, jwenio uyo ngabampoteka umutwe nu kuntenda ilebe yaoni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Akola nng'onda benia ngabankinga kabele mmanda jonge kwa akalemi benia ngabankomanga. Ngabatuma akabanda bange ajingi benia uyo ngabaputigwa, na bange ngabakomigwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ngaika mundu jumwe tu jukuntuma, jwombe mwana jwakwe jwajika ojwampala. Pukujomolela ngankinga jwenio akalenga ‘Manyi mabannyali manango.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nambu akalemi benia ngabalengalana, ‘Jonjo nga mwana jwakwe. Nyeme tankome, nu ulichi gwakwe mauba gwito!’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ku nyenie ngabampukila, ngabankoma nu kunnekela kumbeto ja nng'onda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ngabakonya, “Nkola nng'onda atendabole? Apakuika nakakoma akalemi, nakape bandu bange nng'onda gwa mizabibu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bo, nchomangitije Majandiko ganga?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Libwe elikanigwe na akachengi,</para>
  <para style="q">ngoe ligalambwike kube lyambone kupeta goa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nhwalo gongo utendigwe na Angwana ana Nnoongo,</para>
  <para style="q">na lyenie likuomongwa muno kwito!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Akiilongoi Akayahudi ngabajiga kumpukila Yesu, magambu bamanyangite kutenda kulandanakia kwenio kukiba kwabe angweto. Nambu bujogopa nkengeni ga bandu, kunyenie ngabanneka, ngabajabulanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Nhwalo gwa kulepa kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gange Mafalisayo na abankengama Helode ngabakinga bakampukile Yesu kwa malobe gakwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ngabannyendelela, nukulenga, “Aboli, tumanyi kutenda mwenga nga mamundu manonge kweli kunnyogopaje mundu jwajoa. Kujalije kinala cha mundu nambu mmola kweli ja ndela ja Nnoongo. Mutulengele, bo, malagilo gito galenga ipaligwe kulepa kodi ku nkolongwa jwa Loma? Tulepe andaje takalepaje?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngamanya echibapala, ngabajanga, “Mboni nnyiganga kundega? Unete luela nulubone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ngabanete lumwe, jwombe ngabakonya, “Kumiyo na liina lende lyabene?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ngabajanga, “Kwa Akolongwa ba Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Ga Nkolongwa jwa Loma mampa Nkolongwa jwa Loma, ga Nnoongo mampagange Nnoongo. Ngabanhwomwanga muno Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nhwalo gwa kuyoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bange Masadukayo, abalenga kubije kuyoka ngabannyendele Yesu, ngabankonya, <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Aboli, Musa atulagila nyene, ‘Mundu andawile na kaleka akege gwangabe na mwana, nnung'una mundu batole malekwe, kupala bampotole nnung'una gwakwe ingota.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bai, pakiba na akalongo saba, nkolongwa ngatola munkege mwene ngawe pangabe na mwana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Jwapabele ngatola malekwe nawele jwenio, na jwenio uyo ngajomoka pangapoto mwana. Ngibe uyo kwa nnung'una jwa tatu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Akanung'na boa saba ngabaweganga pangapoto mwana. Pukujomolela munkege jola uyo ngawe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bai, bandu pabapakuyoka, lichoba lya kuyoka bandu, amama benia biba aanaba ba beneke? Kwa magambu boa saba bakiba bantoile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela, “Mangweto nnemwangite muno! Mmanyi kwa magambu gwanike? Kwa magambu mmanyingitije Majandiko wala uwecho gwa Nnoongo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gambu abawilengite apabapakuyoka bitolaje akege wala kutoligwa na analome, bibaganga anda akapakachi ba kumbengu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nambu kunhwalo gwa kuyoigwa kwa abawile, bo, nchomangitije Kitabu cha Musa paali pa kindumba echikikiba chakajaka mwoto? Nnoongo ngannengela Musa, ‘Nenga na Nnoongo ba Ulaimu, Nnoongo jwa Isaka na Nnoongo jwa Yakobo.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Jwombe nga Nnoongo jwa bandu ababi momi, nambu jwa abawileje. Mangweto ntekulemwa muno.”</para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ngolongwa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Jumwe jwa akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngaika, ngajoa kutaukana kwabe. Ngamanya kutenda Yesu bajanga tela, kunyenie ngannyendelela ngankonya, “Amuli jako ejibi ngolongwa kupeta joa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Amuli ejibi ngolongwa jenje, ‘Mpenikie, Mangweto bandu ba Kuisilaeli! Angwana ana Nnoongo bito, nga Angwana bito. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mapale Angwana ana Nnoongo binu kwa mojo gwinu gwoa, kwa kiuke chinu choa kwa malango ginu goa, na kwa makakala ginu goa.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Na jibena ngajenje, ‘Mumpale nndami nnyinu anda pimikipala mmene.’ Jibije amuli jenge ejibi ngolongwa muno kuipeta yenje ibena.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Penia Aboli ba Malagilo ga Musa ngabannengela Yesu, “Chwapi, Maboli! Kweli, anda apannengite, kutenda Nngwana nga Nnoongo na kuyenie abije nnongo jonge nambu jwenio. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na kumpala Nnoongo kwa mojo gwinu gwoa na kwa malango ginu goa na kwa makakala ginu goa na kumpala nndami nnyinu anda apamikipala mmene, nhwalo gongo gwa mbone muno kupeta kumpe Nnoongo lilumbo li inyama yu kutinia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu apalola kutenda mundu jwenio annyanga chwapi, ngannengela jwombe, “Mwenga mmi kutaalije na Kingwana cha Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kuboka penia mundu ajigiteje kunkonya kilebe.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukonyana nhwalo gwa Kilisto Nkomboi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mangobu Yesu apakiba akabola ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo, ngakonya, “Mboni akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa balenga kutenda Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo nga Mwana jwa Daudi? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Uhuke jwa Chwapi annongolea Daudi ngalenga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Angwana ngabalengela Angwana bango,</para>
  <para style="q">ntame kingonu chango cha kalelo</para>
  <para style="q">mpaka apambakabeka akangondwa binu pae ja makongono ginu.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Daudi mwene ankema, ‘Angwana’, Bai, Kilisto Nkomboi ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo iwechakanabo kube mwana jwa Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Bandu ajingi abampenakia Yesu ngabaalalila muno.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bakelebuya na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu apabola angweto, ngalenga, “Magajogopange akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa, abapala kutyanga na ngobo yabe yina miniko eibambigwe nu kupala kupatigwa abali ni ichima kuchoko, <verse number="39" style="v"/>abachagula itebu ina ichima mu nyumba ja kugongalela na paali pina ichima pa mpapala. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kapokanga ilebe akanawele na kajibanga angweto nyumba yabe, na ukopakea kunng'ongalela Nnoongo muno. Ukumu jabe jiba ngolongwa muno lichoba lya hukumu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lilumbo lya nawele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba atamite papipi ni lichanduku lya malumbo, akalolela bandu apabapanga uloi gwabe. Bina uloi ajingi ngaba panganga uloi nduu, <verse number="42" style="v"/>penia ngaika nawele nhwocho nu kupanga uloi gwa lyaba ibena. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabakemanga akinapunji bakwe, ngabalengela, “Kweli nannengelanga, amama nawele aba babekite uloi ndu mulichanduku kapeta boa. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Gambu boa ngabapanga kile echibapatite nyonjakea uloi gwabe, nambu amama aba, bapangite yoa eyabakiba nayo, bapangite yoa eyabakweti babe na bwomi muno.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonge nhwalo gwa kubomoka kwa Nyumba ja Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba akaboka pa Nyumba ja Nnoongo, napunji jwakwe jumwe ngannengela, “Nnole, Aboli! Apagaalile mabwe ganga na nyumba yakwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Mibona nyumba yenje ngolongwa? Libije ati libwe limwe elipakuigala panani ja lenge, kila kilebe makibomoligwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga na kupotekigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba atamite pikitombi cha Mizeituni, ngalola ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo, Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana na Andulea ngabankonya pa ntemela. <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Mutulengele ikobo yenje ipakuika li? Na kiingi nike echikipakubonekana kutenda ikobo yenje ibandakile kupitila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalenge, “Mma maha akankoloya munduje. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bandu ajingi, mabaika mabikikema liina lyango, kulenga, ‘Nenga nga jwenio!’ Bombe mabaoyanga bandu ajingi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pampakujoa nhwalo gwa ngondo papipi andaje kutaali makajogopaje. Ilebe yene mpaka ipitile, nambu kupela kwene kubi tango. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kilambo chimwe kiputana ni kilambo chenge, kingwana chimwe kiputana ni kingwana chenge, kulendema lutope makuba kila paali na njala. Ikobo yenie iba andi lipyanda lya kubelekwa kwa mwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Nambu mangweto mmaganga maha. Bandu mabampelekanga kamabalacha, nu kumputanga bokola mumajumba gabe gu kugongalela. Na bapampeleka nnongi ja akatawala na akangwana kwa magambu gangune, kupala unjalakiche kwabe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nambu tangu nu kuikaje pukupela, Nhwalo Gwambone mpaka utangachigwe kwa bandu boa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kingobu chabapa kuntakiana nu kumpeleka kamaakama, makapweleje kilebe champakulongela, mangobu pagapakuika, nnengange chachote echimpakupata, gambu mangwetoje andaje mpakulongela, nambu gabakuboka kwa Uhuke jwa Chwapi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mundu anng'aluka nnunagwakwe akomigwe, na awawa banng'aluka mwana gwabe, ni ingota mayajingalila achikibelei mundu na kakomanga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bandu boa bapakunchimwa mangweto kwa magambu ga liina lyango. Nambu ojwapakuimbalila mpaka kupela nga ojwapakomboka.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga muno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Apampakulola ‘Libaja’ Lijemite paali pangapakwe, ojwachoma na amanye mana gakwe, penia, ababi ku Yudea batililange kwitombi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ojwabi kunani ja kinyanga cha nyumba akaulukaje kujingila munyumba jakwe kutola kilebe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ojwabi kunng'onda akabujaje unyuma kutola ngobu jakwe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bapakulaga akikege bina ndumbo na akinamama ababi ni ilemba eijonga machoba genia! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Munnyope Nnoongo kupala ikobo yenie yakapiti mangobu ga malilije. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gambu kingobu chenie kubakube kulaga kwenio kwanapitije tangu Nnoongo apapangana dunia mpaka lele, na ipitije kabele. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nambu Angwana bate kupunguya na yeneje akabije mundu jukomboka. Nambu kwa magambu ga bandu bakwe abapambuligwe, Angwana bapungwiye machoba genia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Anda mundu annengi, ‘Nno, Kilisto Nkomboi abi pamba,’ Andaje ‘Abi papa,’ Makanhwaminije. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Gambu papakupiti makilisto buwangi na akalondoli buwangi. Na benia balayanga iingi na yukuomongwa yakaoyanga bandu, ata kubandu abapambuligwe na Nnoongo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mmaganga maha. Nenga nannengelinge ikobo yoa pangapitila.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwika kwakwe Mwana jwa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mumachoba genia, kuboka pa kulaga kwenio, lichoba liba lubendu na mwei ung'alaje, <verse number="25" style="v"/>ndondwa ibakugwe kuboka kumbengu, na makakala ga mbengu gabakutikatika. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwana jwa Mundu abakupitila mumaunde kwa makakala makolongwa ni kibumo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Jwenio apakakinga akapakachi bakwe kuboka kumbengu ingonu yoa ya dunia bakongolange bandu abapambuligwe na Nnoongo kuboka kujitumbwi dunia mpaka kujipei mbengu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanakia kwa nkongo gwa ngokwa ya kulye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mukibolange kikilandanakia na nkongo ntini. Kingobu ndambi yakwe pitumbu kututuba maamba, mmanya kutenda mangobu ga mauno gaike. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nu uyo mangweto pampakibona ilebe yenie yoa ikapitilaga, mmanya Mwana jwa Mundu abi papipi kuika. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli, kingolo chenje kipetaje pangapitila genia goa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mbengu na dunia maipeta, nambu malobe gango gapetaje ngu.</para>
  <para style="s">Abije mundu ojwamanyi lichoba andaje kingobu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayo 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nambu, nhwalo gu lichoba andaje kingobu abije mundu ojwamanyi kiika lii, na akapakachi bukumbenguje, na Mwanaje, nambu Awawa jika jabe nga abamanyi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mmegange maha na nkelukiyange, magambu mmanyangitije kingobu chenie kipakuika lii. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Maiba anda mundu ojwaboka pachakwe kujenda mwanja, nakalekalanga akapakachi bakwe kinala, kila mundu ni liengo lyakwe, nu kuboka penia ngannenge nnendei aba mio. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nkelukiange, kwa magambu mmanyingitije akola nyumba babuja lii, pangaje iba kimuyo, panakati nakati ja kilo, kindabindabi andaje kindabi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Anda aike kingobutu akankolelangaje nng'olokinge. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Aganannenge mangweto, nannenge mmoa, nkelukiange!”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nhwalo gwa kunkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Gakaigala machoba mabena kuika Mpapala gwa Pasaka na Mikate jangajela kimela. Akakung'i akolongwa na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa bapalanga ndela ja kumpukila Yesu kwa chili na bankome. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nambu ngabalenga, “Tukampukije mangobu ga mpapala, bandu bakaikangaje kutendanga kijonga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apakaigwa mauta ku kilambo cha ku Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu akiba ku Betania kachakwe Simoni, ojwakiba juna maloi. Apakiba akalya chakulya, ngabaika amama bamwe abakiba na chupa cha alabasta china mauta gina kunungila muno ga nalido gina bei ngolongwa. Ngakajula chupa chenie, ngannyitila Yesu mauta genia umutwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bandu bange abakibanga penia ngabachimwa nu kulengelana, “Kwa nike kugatunia mauta gangano! <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kabi gauchigwe ku bei ngolongwa, nu kwela kunnepa nkamu maengo kwa yaka itatu, nu uloi gwene kape akaocho!” Ngabakalapila amama benia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngabalengela, “Malekange! Mboni machumbuya? Batei chwapi ni kile chambone kwango. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Akaocho mmilingite nabo kila machoba, na kingobu chachoa echimpala, nhwechi kajangata angweto. Nambu mmeje kila machoba na nanenga. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Jwombe ateile apaotwile, aupakie mmele gwango mauta kumbanganila kwa machiko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli kutenda, padunia poa pupakutangachigwa Nhwalo Gwambone, kitendwa chenje chibatei amama aba kibakulongaligwa kakombake benia.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ajeketela kunng'aluka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kubokapenia Yuda Isikalioti, jumwe kati ja akinapunji komi na abena, ngajenda kwa akakung'i akolongwa ibe anng'aluke Yesu kwabe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolo ngabaalalila apabajoa nhwalo gwenio, nu kulagila kumpe uloi jwenio. Penia Yuda ngabe akapala ndela ju kunng'aluka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alye chakulya cha Mpapala gwa Pasaka pamwe na akinapunji bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-23">Luka 22:7-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lichoba lya kutumbula kwa Mpapala gwa Mikate janga jela kimela, lichoba lya mwana limbelele jwa Pasaka kuchinjigwa, akinapunji bakwe ngabankonyanga Yesu, “Mpala tumpanganile ko Mpapala gwa Pasaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabakinga akabele kati ja akinapunji bakwe ngabalengela, “Nnyendange kunnyini, na mankongana na mundu jumwe ojwapotwi kibega cha mache. Mankengamange, <verse number="14" style="v"/>mpaka munyumba ejapakujingi, makannengele nkola nyumba, ‘Aboli balenga, chumbi chako echimbakulele mpapala gwa Pasaka pamwe na akinapunji bango?’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Na jwenio mannayanga chumbi kikolongwa kugolofa, echikipanganigwe kijomoligwe, mpangania mwenio.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngababokanga, ngabajenda kunnyini, ngibikikole kila kilebe tela andi Yesu apabalengalinge, ngabapangania mpapala gwa Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apiika kimuyo, Yesu ngaika pamwe na akinapunji bakwe komi na abena. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Apabakibanga bakalyaga, Yesu ngalenga, “Nannengelanga mangweto kutenda jumwe kati jinu apakung'aluka, jumwe kati jinu ojwalye pamwe nanenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabaechuka ngabatumbu kunkonya Yesu, jumwe jumwe, “Bo, nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu ngabajanga, “Nga mundu jumwe kati jinu mangweto komi na abena, ojwalela nkate pamwe na nenga muntungati. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwana jwa Mundu mawa andi pagalenga Majandiko Gachwapi nhwalo gwa jwenio, nambu, kulaga mundu jwenio ojwapakunng'aluka Mwana jwa Mundu! Yakabi mbaya kwa mundu jwenio anda akabelwikije!”</para>
  <para style="s">Chakulya cha Angwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Akakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Apabakiba bakalyaganga, Yesu ngatola nkate, ngalumba, ngaumetula na kapaganga akinapunji bakwe, nukulenga, “Ntolange, gongo mmele gwango.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngatola kikombe, nganng'ongolela Nnoongo, ngabapaganga, na boa ngabanyweganga mukikombe chenie. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ngalenga, “Jenje nga myai jango ejijitika kwa bandu ndu, myai jango ejichalakicha lilagano lya Nnoongo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nannengelanga kweli, nyweje kabele divai mpaka lichoba elimbakunywe divai nhyono ku Kingwana cha Nnoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kuboka pu kujemba nhwambo, ngabajenda kukitombi cha Mizeituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondola kutenda Petulo apakunkana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu ngabalengela akinapunji bakwe, “Mmoa mwenga mpakutilanga na kuneka ne jika, gambu Majandiko galenga, ‘Nnoongo mankoma nchungi, na mambelele goa magapwilikana.’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nambu kuboka pu kuyoka kwango, mbakunnongalela ku Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Petulo ngajanga, “Ata ikabi boa bannekangite, ne nannekaje!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu ngannenge Petulo, “Nannenge kweli kutenda tango nkokoloko nu kubekaje pabena kilo, mpakungana patatu kutenda umanyije nenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nambu Petulo ngajendeke kulenga, “Nengaje yenie, ati nakapaligwe kuwe pamwe na mwenga!”</para>
  <para style="p">Na akinapunji boa ngabalenga uyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agongalela ku Gesisemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ngabaikanga paali apakemigwa Getisemani, na Yesu ngabalenge akinapunji bakwe, “Ntamange pamba mangobu ne nakagongalela.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ngantola Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana. Ngabe na mbwele na ngaechuka muno, <verse number="34" style="v"/>ngabalenge, “Mbi na kuechuka muno umwojo papipi nu kuwe. Ntamange pamba na nkelukiange.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ngajenda nnongi kachoko, ngakileke pae manguku, ngagongalela Nnoongo kutenda, anda iwechikine, akapeteje mangobu genia ga kupotekigwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ngagongalela, “Awabango, kwinu kila kilebe kuwechekana. Umokeye kikombe chenje chukupotekigwa. Nambu ikabe anda apambalaje, nambu pampala mwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kubokapenia ngababuji akinapunji bakwe akatatu bala, ngabakole bagochilinge. Ngannenge Petulo, “Simoni, bo, nng'ochile? Nhwotwije ukelukia ata kingobu chimwe?” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Penia ngabalengela, “Nkelukiange na kugongalela kupala makalondoigwaje. Mwojo utenda kupala, nambu mmele ulegalike.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ngajenda kugongale kabele, ngabuji malobe ugaga. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Penia ngabuja kabele, ngabakolelanga bagochalinge. Mio gabe gakiba na lugono. Bamanyangiteje chukunnyanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Apabuja mala ja patatu ngabalengela, “Mmilingite tango makagolokanga nu kupomolela? Itochite! Kingobu kiike! Nnole, Mwana jwa Mundu ngoe bankamuya kwa bandu akabaja. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nnyinukange tujende. Atendakuika ojwapakung'aluka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kujigiligwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu apakiba tango akalongela kingobu Yuda, jumwe kati ja akinapunji bakwe apaika. Ngaika pamwe nankengeni nkolongwa gwa manjolinjoli pamwe na mapanga na imbonga, na ngankamuya kwa akakung'i akolongwa, na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa, na akananhota. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mundu ojwapala kunng'aluka Yesu, akiba tayali aulaite kiingi nkengeni gwenio kulenga, “Mundu ojumbakunkumbatila ngajwenio. Mampukilange na mammekange pulenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kingobutu Yuda apaika, ngannyendele Yesu nu kulenga, “Aboli!” Penia ngankumbatila. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kuyene ngabampukilanga Yesu nu kummekanga mumakakala. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nambu jumwe ojwajemita penia pamwe na Yesu ngaucholomola upanga gwakwe nu kumputa mmanda jwa Nkung'i Nkolongwa, nganhweketa lichikilo. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabalenge, “Bo, mboni nhwikalinge na mapanga na imbonga kumbukila nenga, anda ne napoki? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kila lichoba nakiba pamwe namangweto nakammolanga ku Nyumba ja Nnoongo, na wala umbukilingije. Nambu Majandiko Gachwapi galenganile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Penia akinapunji boa ngabanneka nu kutila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Pakiba na kakombo jumwe ojwakiba akankengama Yesu akiba akwindite lutando. Ngabajiganga kumpukila, <verse number="52" style="v"/>nambu jwombe ngapokonyoka, ngaluleka lutando lola, ngabutuka makengele.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nnongi ja Libalacha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Penia Yesu ngabantola mpaka ku nyumba ja Nkung'i Nkolongwa, penia bakiba na akakung'i akolongwa boa, ikinanhota na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa bakibanga bakonganinge. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Petulo ngabe kutaali akankengama Yesu, ngajingi mu uwa ja nyumba ja Nkung'i Nkolongwa. Ngatama pamwe na akalendei, akajota mwoto. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Akakung'i Akolongwa na Libalacha lyoa ngabapalanga uchaili gu kuntakiana Yesu kupala akomigwe, nambu bapatangitije. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Bandu ndu ngabapianga uchaili guwangi ku Yesu, nambu uchaili gwabe ujeketeligweje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Kubokapenia bandu bange ngabajema kulenga uchaili guwangi ku Yesu, <verse number="58" style="v"/>“Ngutunnyoa mundu ojo apalenga, ‘Mbakubomola Nyumba ja Nnoongo ejichengigwe na bandu, nu kuchenga jenge kwa machoba matatu jangachengigwa na bandu.’ ” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Nambu ata angweto, uyo, uchaili gwabe ujeketeligwije.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Nkung'i Nkolongwa ngajema nnongi jabe boa nu kunkonya Yesu, “Bo nnyanguje kwa bandu bamba abantakiana mwenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ngatama nu alongije ata lilobe limwe. Nkung'i Nkolongwa ngankonya kabele, “Bo, mwenga nga Kilisto Nkomboi Mwana ojwapambuligwe na Nnoongo juna Kibumo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu ngajanga, “Nenga, nga jwenio, kabe mamammona Mwana jwa Mundu atamite kingonu cha kalelo cha Angwana Bina Makakala na akaika mumaunde ga kumbengu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Penia Nkung'i Nkolongwa ngapapula lutando lwakwe kulaya lilaka lyakwe, ngalenga, “Tupaije akachaili! <verse number="64" style="v"/>Nnyoaninge apantukana Nnoongo. Mangweto nhwachangabo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Boa ngubunhukumula kutenda, apaligwa kuwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Bange kati jabe ngabatumbu kunhuni mata Yesu, ngabanhwiba kumio, ngabamputa. Nu kunnengela, “Nnondole nga beneke abamputite!” Ati akalendei ngabantolanga, ngabamputanga makopi.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo ankana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Petulo akiba tango pae kuua, mmanda jumwe munkege jwa Nkung'i Nkolongwa ngaika. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Apammona Petulo akajota mwoto, ngannolekea, ngannengela, “Ati mwenga uyo makiba pamwe na Yesu jwa ku Nazaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Nambu Petulo ngakana. “Numanyije, ati echinnongela mbi kikimanyaje!” Kubokapenia Petulo ngajenda panja kuua. Penia nkokoloko ngabeka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Mmanda munkege jola apammona kabele Petulo, ngatumbu kabele kalenge bandu abakibanga bajemangite penia, “Mundu jonjo nga jumwe kati jabe!” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Nambu Petulo ngakana kabele.</para>
  <para style="p">Kingobu tu, bandu abakibanga bajemangite penia ngabannenge Petulo, “Kweli mwenga nga mabamwe kati jabe, gambu mwenga uyo mmoke ku Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Nambu Petulo ngalenga, “Napila yenie kutenda nenga kweli! Nnoongo awechite kunhukumu ne anda nenga uwangi! Numanyi mundu ojunnongela minhalo jakwe!” <verse number="72" style="v"/>Penia nkokoloko ngabeka kabele, na Petulo ngakombokela Yesu apannengile, “Tango nkokoloko nukubekaje, mpakungana patatu kutenda umanyije ne.” Petulo ngakilikitila nu kuguta.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bampeleka kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pukuchaga, akakung'i akolongwa ngababeka machabuli pamwe na akinanhota na akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa na Libalacha lyoa, ngabalagana kuntaba Yesu mitondolo, ngabampeleka kunkamuya Pilato. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pilato ngankonya Yesu, “Bo, mwe nga Mangwana ba Akayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu ngajanga, “Elo, mwe nengite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolongwa bantakiine Yesu ilebe ndu, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilato ngankonya kabele Yesu, “Bo, nnyangaje lilobe? Nnyowa apabanchalakicha mwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nambu Yesu ajangitije lilobe, mpaka Pilato ngaomongwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bunhukumu kuwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohana 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kila mangobu ga mpapala gwa Pasaka, Pilato akiba na lukobo lwa kaleke mpungwa jumwe ojubampaile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kingobu chenie, pakiba na mundu jumwe ojwa kemigwa Balaba, atabigwe mikipungo kwa magambu gu ukoma. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kingobu pabakongana bandu nu kunnyopa Pilato batendelange lukobo lwakwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pilato ngabakonyanga, “Bo, mpalanga nannekelange Nngwana jwa Akayahudi?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Alenga yene magambu amanyi kutenda akakung'i akolongwa bankamwie Yesu kwakwe kwa magambu ga bwiu tu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nambu akakung'i akolongwa ngabakweleke bandu bannyope Pilato banyogole Balaba. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pilato ngabakonya kabele bandu ba, “Ngoe mpala nantendibo mundu jonjo ojumankemanga Angwana ba Akayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bandu boa ngabatondobea lilobe kabele, “Mammambe panchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu Pilato ngabakonya, “Kwa nike! Atei ubaja gani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nambu angweto ngabayanga kulenga kanonoya, “Mammambe panchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pilato apala kaalalila bandu, bai, ngannekeke Balaba apite mikipungo. Ngaamulicha Yesu abambigwe panchalaba.</para>
  <para style="s">Akalenda bammeka nhwenyo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Manjolinjoli ngagampeleka Yesu panganya ja boma, ngabakongana ikuta yoa ya manjolinjoli. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ngabankwindiya Yesu ngobo ya kingwana, ngabapota luchengo lwa miba, ngabankwindiya umutwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngabatumbu kunnamukia, “Nname muno Mangwana ba Akayahudi!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Benia ngabamputa nnai umutwe, ngubunhuni mata, ngaba kilikitila nu kunnitila kunhwenyo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuboka pu kummeke nhwenyo ngubunhwula ngobo ji Kingwana nu kunkwindiya ngobo yakwe kabele. Ngabampeleka kummamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abambigwa panchalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Undela, ngabankole mundu jumwe ojwakemigwa Simoni, ojwaika kunnyini kuboka kung'onda. Manjolinjoli ngaga nhwamulicha aupotole nchalaba gwa Yesu. Simoni akiba jwa kilambo cha Kulene akiba awawa ba Alekizanda na Lufusi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Benia ngabantola Yesu ngabampeleka mpaka paali papakemigwa Goligota, mana gakwe, paali pi “Kitongo cha Mutwe.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Benia ngabajiganga kumpe divai ejibatindagine na manemane, nambu jwombe ngakana kunywe jenie. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngabammambanga nu kubagana ngobo yakwe bene akangweto kukuoma kiumbuumbu bamanye kila mundu chapakupata! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ikiba kindabi nunhwana apabammambanga Yesu panchalaba. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Litangacho lya lukumbi lwa jwenio liandikigwe yene, “Nngwana jwa Akayahudi.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pamwe na jwenio bakabambigwa na akapoki abena jumwe kingonu cha kalelo na jonge kingono cha kangeja. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Penia ngagalenganila Majandiko Gachwapi agalenga, “Ngaba mmeka pamwe na akabaja.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bandu abapetanga paali penia ngabammona Yesu ngabantukana kulenga, “Aha! Nnyenda makabomola Nyumba ja Nnoongo nu kuchenga kwa machoba matatu! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ngoe nhwuluke panchalaba mikikombole mmene!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Akakung'i akolongwa pamwe na Akaboli ba Malagilo ga Musa apabammona Yesu ngabalenga, “Ngabakombo bange, nambu aotwije kukikombola mwene! <verse number="32" style="v"/>Konda jwenio nga Kilisto Nkomboi, Nngwana jwa Isilaeli! Tummone anda aulwike panchalaba, na twe matunhwamina.”</para>
  <para style="p">Na baba akabena ababambigwa pamwe na Yesu ba ngabantukana uyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajomoka panchalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ikiba saa sita nalumu mpaka saa tisa kimuyo lubendu ngulutanda kilambo choa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Saa tisa kimuyo Yesu ngaguta kwa lilobe likolongwa, ngalenga, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Mana gakwe, “Nnoongo jwango, Nnoongo jwango, mboni uneka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bandu bange abajemangita penia abannyoanga jwenio ngabalenga, “Mpenikie! Ankema Eliya.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Jumwe kati jabe ngabutuka, ngatola litonji ngalichwika musiki, ngalitabalila munnai ngantondobeke anywe ngalenga, “Nyemitulole anda Eliya maika kunhwuluya panchalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu ngaguta kanonoya, ngajomoka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Panjia ja nkati ja Nyumba ja Nnoongo elibagina pa Chwapi ja Nnoongo ngijipachuka ipande ibena kuboka kunani mpaka pae. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kilongoi jwa akalenda ba Loma akiba ajemite nnongi ja nchalaba apalola kiwe chawa Yesu, ngalenga, “Kweli mundu ojo akiba Mwana jwa Nnoongo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Akikege bange bakibanga penia bakalola kutaali, pamwe na benia akiba Maliamu Magidalena na Salome, na Malia amama achoko ba Yakobo na Yusufu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Benia bankengama Yesu apakiba ku Galilaya na kummegelela. Bange akikege ajingi abaika Kuyelusalemu uyo bakiba penia.</para>
  <para style="s">Machiko ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ikiba kimuyo apaika Yusufu jwa Alimatayo. Jumwe jwa Libalacha lya chilikali juna Madalaka, jwenio alendela Kingwana cha Nnoongo. Likiba lichoba lya kupanganikia kujimukila Lichoba lya Kupomalela. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yene ngaika Yusufu mundu ju kilambo cha Alimatayo, akiba jumwe kati ji kikuta kikolongwa jwapata ichima muno. Jwombe uyo alendela kuika kingwana cha Nnoongo. Penia ngannyendele Pilato pangajogopa ngajopa bampe mmele gwa Yesu <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pilato ngaomongwa kujoa kita Yesu ajomwike. Ngankema nnenda nkolongwa ngankonya anda Yesu ajomoka tango kindae. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pilato apannyoa nnenda nkolongwa kutenda Yesu ajomwike, nganyeketela Yusufu autole mmele gwa Yesu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yusufu ngaemela ngobo nhuu ja kitani ngauluya pae mmele gwa Yesu ngaubiligila chanda. Ngaubeka mulikabuli elikiba liembigwe piliganga, kubokapenia ngalipilimbia libwe likolongwa nnongi ja nniango gu likabuli. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Maliamu Magidalena na Maliamu amamundu Yusufu ngabapabona pububekite mmele gwa Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuboka pi Lichoba li Kupomolela kupeta, Maliamu Magidalena na Salome na Maliamu amamundu Yakobo ngabaeme mauta ga kunungila ibe bukupakaye mmele gwa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lichoba lya jumapili kindabindabi, ngabajenda kulikabuli, lichoba apalitumbula kupita. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na angweto ngababe bakalengelana, “Mene ojwapa kutubokea libwe paniango gu likabuli?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nambu apabalolanga, ngibilibona libwe liboigwe. Na lyakiba libwe likolongwa muno. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apabajingala mulikabuli, ngabammona kakombo jumwe ojwakwindite ngobo nhuu, atamite kingonu cha kalelo, ngabaomongwa muno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambu kakombo jola ngabalengelanga, “Makaomwangaje,” manyi mampalanga Yesu jwa ku Nazaleti ojwabambigwe munchalaba. Ayokite, abije pamba. Nnolanga paali apabakiba banng'onakinge. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nnyendange makalengelange akinapunji bakwe pamwe na Petulo kutenda apakunnongelelanga kwako ku Galilaya. Kwenio mamammona anda apannengelinge.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ngababoka pilikabuli pala, bakalendema kukujogopa na mbwele. Bannengalingeje mundu kilebe chochoa, magambu batela kujogopa muno.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ampiti Maliamu Magdalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohana 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kuboka pa kuyoka kindabindabi lichoba lya Jumapili, ngatumbula kumpiti Maliamu Magidalena, Yesu ojwammoita michepela saba. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Maliamu Magdalena ngajabula, ngabalengela abakiba pamwe na Yesu. Bakiba bakakokaleka nu kuguta, <verse number="11" style="v"/>na apabannyoa jwenio akalenga kutenda Yesu abi mmomi nu kutenda Maliamu Magdalena ammweni, baaminingije.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapiti akinapunji abena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuboka penia Yesu ngabapitila akinapunji abena kongo agalambwike kumio. Akinapunji benia bakiba bakajenda kukijiji. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Angweto uyo ngabajenda, ngabalengela akajabe, nambu angweto uyo baaminingije.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bapitila akinapunji komi na jumwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Itendwa 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pukujomolela, Yesu ngabapitila akinapunji bakwe komi na jumwe ogubakiba bakalya. Ngabakalapila muno angweto, magambu gwangaamini gwabe nu kutauka kwabe, gambu baaminingeje abakiba bammweni kuboka pa kuyoka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ngabalengela, “Nnyendange kudunia joa makatangachange Nhwalo Gwambone ku kila mundu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ojwaamini nu kubatichigwa apaukomboligwa, jwanga amini apakuhukumigwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ni iingi yenje ipaukengamana nababa abaamini, ku liina lyango bapakuboya michepela na bapakulongela kilonge kiyono. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Anda bakamwi lijoka andaje banywi kilebe chochoa china uchungu, chabengwaje, bapakubeka maboko gabe panani ja akatamwe, nangweto mabalama.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atoligwa kujenda kumbengu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Itendwa 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuboka pa Nngwana Yesu kujomo kulonge nabo, ngatoligwa kujenda Kumbengu nu kummeka kingonu cha kalelo cha Nnoongo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Akinapunji ngabajenda nu kutangacha kila paali, na Angwana ngabakamwa liengo pamwe na angweto kuchalakicha nhwalo gwenio ku iingi eyikengamana nabo.</para>
</usx>
